\id 2KI  
\toc1 Lengte Nina 
\toc2 2 Lengte 
\toc3 2 Lengte 
\mt1 2 KINGS  
\mt2 LENGTE LEKHABU  
\mt3 NINA  
\is1 2 Kings Lekhabu Sung Thu Umdan  
\ip Thusim kigom khom munli hi abih-bih chan akikhenin ahi. Hichu 1 Samuel’a akipanin 2 Kings a akichaije. Alhangpi'n nam sunga kilamkaina thu jeng ahi. Lamkai ho thusim chedol chu lengte thu jeng seh hilouvin, themgao ho leh aseijui ho jaona ahi. Chule Themgao ho chun 1 le 2 Kings lekhabu sunga hin thucheng sang-nga le jakhat le somni le gup aseidoh un, lengte vang chun sangli le jaget le somni le nga aseidoh uve. Hijeh chun thusim hi gamsung thu jeng hilouvin, dengchang tah a Pakaiya kon thupolea pang ho thuseidoh jong ajaovin ahi.  
\ip Lekhabu kipatna lam hi, Themgao ni makaina ahin: Amasan Elijah natoh le ijakai matah in akichaijin; ani channan Elisah in amite chu anung kouvin, Pathen dihtah chu ahousah un ahi.  
\is1 Lekhabu Jih Chule Akijih Kum  
\ip Koipen in ajih ham ti hetdoh ahahsan ahi. Hinlah khanglui laija pat chondan toh kilhon'in, themgao ho lah a phabep chun hiche abih-bih a kihom khen lekhabu hi anajih u ahi tihi alhangpia pomdan ahi. Koiyin anajih hita jongleh, hiche phat laiya thusim chedol akon hetchet bailam pen chu ahi (I Kings 11:41; 14:19, 29). 2 Kings Lekhabu hi 853 le 562 BC sunga kijih ahi.  
\is1 Koi Henga Chule Ipi Dinga Ana Kijih Ham?  
\ip Israel chate Babylon a kon akitol uva, Israel le Judah Thusim chintup a aum jing na ding ahi. Kitah louna a kon thilsoh chung chang ahin, chule suhkhelna akon kihilna ding ahi.  
\ip 1 Samuel apat 2 Kings sung thusim hopli sunga hin, themgao somni le khat hoa kon thu kiseidoh aum'in ahi. Themgao dihtah keo hilouvin, themgao lhem jong ajaovin; kimkhat chu aminthang uvin kimkhat ma chu pannabei, akum lhing le chapang chule numei le pasal jaona ahi.  
\c 1  
\s1 Elijah In Ahaziah Lengpa Akimaitopi  
\p
\v 1 Ahab lengpa thi jouvin, Moab ten Israel dounan gal ahin sat uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 2 Nikhat Israel te leng thah, Ahaziah chu Samaria khopi inchung dan kalbia kon'in ahung kitang-lhan akiha suhkhah lheh jengin ahi. Hijeh chun aman Ekron gam mite semthu pathen Baalzebub hou-in’ah mi asol'in, kadam doh jou ding hinam tin agadoh sah in ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ahin Pakai vantil khat in Tishbe a konna hung Elijah kom’ah – “Chen Samaria lengpa thupole ho khu gakimaito pin lang hitin gaseipeh in, “Israel lah a hi Pathen umlouva hitam? Nangma ipi dinga Ekron semthu pathen Baalzebub kom’a leng damdoh ding leh damdoh louding donga nache ham?” tin gaseipeh tan ati.  
\v 4 Tun, hijehchun, Pakaijin hitin aseije, “Nangin nalupna najalkhun na dalhah louding nathiden tei-tei ding ahitai,” ati. Hiti chun Elijah achen hichu aga seipeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Hichea thupole ho chu lengpa kom agalhun phat un “I-atileh gang tah a nahung kilekit u hitam?” tin adongin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Ama hon adonbut un, “Mikhat kakom uvah ahungin nangho kilekit uvin lang hiche thu hi lengpa kom’a seipeh un eitiuvin ahi,” chuleh Pakaijin hitin aseije – “Israel te lah a Pathen umlou hija Ekron gam’a semthu pathen Baalzebub kom’a na damdoh ding le na damdoh louding donga nache uham?” atipeh uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Lengpan adongin “Ama chu itobang mihem ham? Chule alim chu itobang ham?” tin ana ledoh kit in ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Ama hon adonbut un, “Ama chu asam asaovin chuleh akongah savun konggah akigah e,” atiuve.  
\p Hichun lengpan jong, “Tishbe a konna Elijah hichula em?” ati. \x + \xo 1:8 \xt Matt 3:4; Mk 1:6\x*   
\p
\v 9 Hijou chun aman sepai lamkai khat chu asepai somnga toh, Elijah man ding chun asol tan ahi. Ama hon molchung khat a atoupet agamu uvin ahi. Sepai lamkaipan ama kom’a chun, “Pathen mipa lengpa thupeh dungjuijin hung kumlhan kilhon uhite,” ati.   
\p
\v 10 Ahin Elijah in sepai lamkaipa kom’a, “Keima Pathen mi kahileh vanna kon'in meikong hung lenglhan tin nang leh namite somnga chu sumang hen,” ati. Hichun vanna kon'in meikong ahung lenglhan amaho chu athat gamtan ahi. \x + \xo 1:10 \xt Lk 9:54\x*   
\p
\v 11 Hijeh chun lengpan mi somnga toh sepai lamkai khat ma asol kit in, sepai lamkaipa chun “Pathen mipa lengpan hung kumlha loihen ati,” aga tin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hichun Elijah in adonbut in, “Keima Pathen mi kahi leh vanna kon'in meikong hunglha henlang nang le namite som nga chu sumang hen,” ati. Chuti chun vanna kon'in meikong ahung lenglhan amaho chu athat gam kittan ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Avellin lengpan jong athum channa in sepai lamkai khat mi somnga toh asol kit in ahi. Ahin tuvang'in sepai lamkaipa chu molchung'ah akal touvin Elijah kengbul’ah akhup boh in achun akom’a chun ataovin, “Vo Pathen mipa, kei leh nasohte mi somnga ho hi nei hinghoi teiteijun.  
\v 14 Ven vanna konna meikong hung lenglha chun mi loini chu athat gamtan ahi. Tunvang lungset tah in nei hinghoi teijun!” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hichun Pakai vantil khat in Elijah kom’ah hitin aseije, “Ama hitoh kumlha khom lhon'in, ama hi kicha hih in” ati. Hiti chun Elijah akipatdoh in ama chutoh lengpa kom’ah chun achelhon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Elijah in lengpa kom’a chun, “Pakaijin hitin aseije nangin ipi bolla Ekron mite semthu pathen Baalzebub kom’a na damdoh ding le na damdoh louding thu donga nasol ham? Israel te lah a Pathen umlou hitam? Hitia hi nachon jeh in tua nalupna hi na dalhah louhel ding ahitai; chuleh nathi tei-tei ding ahi.” atipeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hiti chun Pakaijin Elijah mang chan aseidohsa athutep bang-bang chun Ahaziah chu athi tan ahi. Ahaziah chun ama goulo ding chapa aneilou jeh chun asopipa Joram chu ama banin leng ahung chang tan ahi. Hiche hi Judah leng Jehoshaphat chapa Jehoram leng vaihom kumni channa thilsoh ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Ahaziah vaihom sunga thilsoh dang ho chu \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a chun akisunlut in ahi.   
\c 2  
\s1 Elijah Themgao Van'a Lahtouva Aum  
\p
\v 1 Pakaijin Elijah chu chimpei mangchan vanna alahtou ding konin Elijah leh Elisha chu Gilgal a kon’in ahung kijot lhon'in ahi.  
\v 2 Elijah in Elisha kom’ah “Nangma hiche mun ahin ana umtan, Pakaijin keima Bethel chan geija che dingin eiseije,” ati.  
\p Ahin Elisha’n adonbut in, “Hing jing Pakai leh nangma hinlai sen, Keiman nangma ka dalhah louhel ding nahi!” ati. Hiti chun amani Bethel kho ah akijotlut lhon tai.   
\p
\v 3 Themgao kiloikhom phabep ho chu Bethel’a konin Elisha komah ahungun hitin ana dong tauve, “Tunia hi Pakaijin na pupa hi nanga konna alahtou ding ahitai ti nahet hinam?” atiuve. Elishain adonbut in, “Kahenai, ahin, hiche thua hin thipbeh in um uvin,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Chujouvin Elijah in Elisha kom’ah, “Nangma hikom’a hin ana umtan keima vang Pakaijin Jericho chan che dingin eideije,” ati. Ahin Elisha’n adonbut kit in, “Hinjing Pakai leh nangma na hinjing laisen keiman na dalha ponge” ati. Hiti chun Jericho geijin achekhom kit lhontai.   
\p
\v 5 Hijou chun Jericho a kon'in themgao phabep Elisha kom’ah ahungun, “Pakaijin napupa hi nanga konna tuni nikhoa hi alahmang ding ahitai ti nahet hinam?” atiuve.  
\p Elisha’n adonbut in “Kahenai, ahin thipbeh in um'un,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hijeh chun, Elijah in Elisha kom’ah aseijin “Hichea hin ana umtan ajeh chu kei hi Pakaijin Jordan Vadung geija che dingin aseije,” ati.  
\p Ahin Elisha’n adonbut in, “Hinjing Pakai leh nangma nahin jing laisen, Keiman nangma dalha ponge” ati. Hiti chun amani akijot kit lhon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Themgao honho lah a kon'in mi somnga acheuvin Elijah leh Elisha Jordan vadung chan gei akijot lhon chu agalvet un ahi.  
\v 8 Hichun Elijah in aponsil chu ajel tumin twi chung chu ajep a ahileh vadung chu ahung kikhen in, anilhon chun agalkai lhon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Amani agalkai lhon phat in Elijah in Elisha kom’ah, “Keima lahtouva kaum kah a ipi kabolpeh thei ding um am seijin,” ati.  
\p Chuin, Elisha’n adonbut in, “Nangma thalheng kahi theina dingin na lhagao chan hi jatni in nei chansah in,” ati. \x + \xo 2:9 \xt Danbu Ni Na 21:17\x*   
\p
\v 10 Elijah in adonbut in, “Nathil thum hi thil hahsa tah khat nathum ahi, ahin nangin keima hi nanga konna lahtouva kaum neimua ahileh nathum chu namu ding ahi,” atipeh in ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Hitia chu amani kihoulim puma akijotpet lhon chun, pohphungin sakol kangtalai meikong pum in ahung kilah in, meikong lomlah a chun sakol in ahin kaijin ahi. Amani kikah a chun atollut in, amani chu asep khen lhon'in, Elijah chu chimpaijin van langa apuitou tan ahi.  
\v 12 Elisha’n hichu amun apengjah jengin, “Hepa! Hepa! Keiman Israel te sakol kangtalai leh sakol kangtalai tol ho kamun ahi!” ati. Chuin Elijah chu akom'a konna amuphah lou phat in, Elisha’n lungkham tah in apon chu abot-tel in ahi. \x + \xo 2:12 \xt 2 Lengte 13:14\x*   
\p
\v 13 Elijah lahtouva aum phat in, ahung lenglha Elijah ponchol chu Elisha in akilah tan ahi. Hijou chun Elisha chu Jordan Vadung panga chun ahung kile tan ahi.  
\v 14 Aman vadung twi chu Elijah ponchol chun ajep in hitin asamtan ahi, “Elijah Pakai, Pathen chu hoiya umma ham?” ati. Hichun vadung chu akikhen in Elisha agalkai tai.   
\p
\v 15 Jericho a konna themgao kiloikhom ho chun Jericho a kon'in thilsoh chu agalmu uvin, hiti hin asam tauvin ahi, “Elijah lhagao chu Elisha chunga achutai,” atiuve. Amaho chu ama kimupi dingin acheuvin amasanga tol’ah abohkhup un,  
\v 16 “Hepu, nangin thu neipe uvin lang keiho lah a ahat cheh mi somnga in gammang lah a hi napupa hol uvinge. Ijem atileh Pakai lhagaovin molchung ham, phaicham ham khatna adalhah maithei ahi.” atiuve.  
\p Elisha’n adonbut in, “Ahipoi, sol hih in,” ati.  
\v 17 Ahinlah ama hon asei tei-tei jengun ahileh, aman anil nomlou phat in, “Aphai sol tauvin,” ati. Hichun mi somnga in nithum lhingset ahol un amu pouvin ahi.  
\v 18 Elisha chu amaho hung kilekit geijin Jericho a ana um nalaijin ahi. “Che hih un kati hilou ham?” ati.   
\s1 Elisha’n Thil Kidang Abol Masah Pen  
\p
\v 19 Nikhat hi Jericho khopia lamkai hon Elisha chu ahung kimupi uvin, “Keihon boina khat kanei uve, Hepu” ahung tiuve, “Nangin namu bangin hiche khopi nomtah le hoitah ahi. Ahinla twi ahah in chuleh agam leiset a jong hin ima aputpon ahi,” ahung tiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Elisha’n amaho kom’ah, “Khonthah khat a chi hinchoijun,” ati. Hichun ama hon jong ahin choijun ahi.  
\v 21 Hijou chun, aman hiche khopi sunga twi hung lonlut patna twinah a chun chi aga seplut in hitin aseitai, “Pakaijin hitin aseije: Keiman hiche twi hi kasutheng tai. Hichea kon a hi thina le ga phalou um talou ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 22 Hiti chun Elisha’n asei bangin hiche nikhoa pat chun twi chu atheng jeng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Elisha’n Jericho chu adalhan Bethel lam ajontan ahi. Hitia chu lamlen na achejing lai chun, hiche khopi sunga konna chapang phabep in atot khum’un noise tah in. “Lutolpa, chedoh in!, Lutolpa, chedoh in!” atiuvin ahi.  
\v 24 Elisha akiheijin amaho chu aven Pakai minin asamse tan ahi. Hichun gammang lah a kon'in Vompi ni ahung potdoh in chapang somli le ni chu abot tellun athat gamtan ahi.  
\v 25 Hichea kon chun Elisha chu Carmel Mol ajonnin khonungin Samaria langa akile in ahi.   
\c 3  
\s1 Israel te Le Moab Gal Kisat  
\p
\v 1 Judah gam’a Jehoshaphat leng vaipoh kum som le get kum chun Ahab chapa Joram in Israel te chunga vai ana pon ahi. Aman Samaria khopia kum som le ni vai ana pon ahi.  
\v 2 Ama hin anu le apa tobang lom in thilse ana bolpon ahinlah Pathen mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin ahi. Ama hin apan ana tundoh Baal houna dia apan ana tun khompi theng ho vang ana volhun ahi.  
\v 3 Ahijeng vang'in Nebat chapa Jeroboam in Israel mipite ana chonset sahna hiche chonsetna chu ana chejompi jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Moab mi Mesha lengpa chu kelngoi chi punsah mi anahi. Ama hin Israel lengpa hi kumseh a kelngoi 100,000 chuleh kelchal 100,000 mul anapehji ahi.  
\v 5 Ahinlah Ahab athi phat in Moab lengpan Israel lengpa ana doutan ahi.  
\v 6 Hijeh chun Joram lengpan jong Samaria a kon'in Israel sepai gangtah in ahin toldoh in ahi.  
\v 7 Lampia chun Judah lengpa Jehoshaphat chu thu thot in, “Moab lengpan kei dounan gal ahin boltan ahi. Amaho toh kisatna dinga hi neihung panhu thei ding hinam? atin ahi.  
\p Hichun Jehoshaphat in adonbut in, “Ibola kahung da ding ham? Nang le kei thakhat ihi chula em? Kei sepai ho chu nang sepai ahin, ka sakol ho chu nang sakol ahi,” ati.  
\v 8 Hijou chun Jehoshaphat in adongin, “Hoiche lampi iho ding ham?” ati.  
\p Joram in adonbut in, “Edom gamthip noija konna inokhum ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hichun Edom lengpan jong ahin jop in, athum’un nisagi sungin gamthip noija chun avel lamin akitollun ahi. Ahin mihem le gancha dingin twi anei tapouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 “Ipi iti diu hitam?” tin Israel lengpa chu ahung pengjah jengin ahi. “Pakaijin ithum uva Moab lengpan ajo dinga hi eihin puilut u hita hila,” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Ahin Judah lengpan Jehoshaphat in, “Ilah uva themgao jaolouva ham? Aum'a ahileh i-iti diuham idoh theiju ahi,” ati.  
\p Joram lengpa noija lamkai khat in ahin donbut in, “Shaphat chapa Elisha chu hikom’a aum'e. Ama hi Elijah noija natong ahi,” ahin tin ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hichun Jehoshaphat in, “Ama kom'a hi Pakaijin thu aseiji ahitai,” ati. Hiti chun Israel te, Judah te chule Edom leng ho chu Elisha gadong dingin ache tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Elisha’n Israel lengpa kom’ah, “Ipi dinga kei kom’a nahung uham? Nanu le napa themgao kom’a nacheu le iti ham?” ati.  
\p Hichun Israel lengpa Joram chun ahipoi, “Pakaijin leng thum ho hi Moab lengpan ajo dinga eihin puilut u ahi bouve,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Elisha’n adonbut in, “Keiman kahou Hatchungnung Pakai minna kasei ahi, Judah lengpa Jehoshaphat kaja lou hileh nang hi kadonlou ding nahi.  
\v 15 Koipen nahiuvem, nalah uva semjang saithem naum uvem? Ama chu kakom’a hinpuilut un,” ati.  
\p Semjang chu asaipeh phat un Pakai thahatna chu Elisha chunga ahung chutan ahileh,  
\v 16 aman hiti hin aseipeh tan ahi, “Pakaijin aseije: Hiche phaicham hi twi dimna twikul hung hi ding ahi.  
\v 17 Nanghon hui le go gin najah lou diu ahi, ahinla hiche phaicham hi twi hung dimset ding ahi. Chutengleh, nang hon nangho ding leh na gancha ho leh ganhing dang ho dinga jong nanei letset diu ahi.  
\v 18 Ahin hiche hi Pakai dinga imacha ahipoi, ajeh chu aman Moab sepai te chunga jong gal najosah diu ahi.  
\v 19 Nanghon akhopiu phalai ho jouse jong chuleh kul kigetkhum ho jong nalah diu, athingphung phalai jeng jong nalah diu, natuh chai diu, atwikhuh hou jeng jong na dippeh diu agam phalai jouse jong song na dipsah diu, na suhmang peh diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Ajing nikho jingkah gan kilhai phat donin, phulou helouvin twi ahung putdoh tan ahi! Hichu Edom lang ngen'ah alongin, chomlou kah in muntin'ah twi aum tan ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Langkhat ah galmi thum, amaho doudin ahung kitol’e tithu Moab miten ajahdoh phat un, ama hon chempai kiko theibep chan geijin gamgi dungjui chun akigol jengun ahi.  
\v 22 Ahinlah ajing jingkah in, athoudoh un ahile nisa chun twi chung chu akhon ahileh Moab mite ding chun asan in, thisan abangtan ahi.  
\v 23 Moab miten asam’un “Hiche khu thisan ahi! Galmi thumho khu amaho le amaho kithat touva ahitai - Moab mite cheu hitin athil’u gakichom uhite!” akitiuve.   
\p
\v 24 Ahinlah Moab mite chu Israel te ngahmun ahunglhun phat un, Israel galmi ho chu alhaidoh un amaho chu anokhum un, Moab gam geijin ano uvin achejom’un thil jouse asubei soh jengun ahi.  
\v 25 Ama hon akhopi hou chu asubeijun, agam phalaiho jouse chu songin adip un, atwikhuh hou asubing un, athingphung pha jouseu aphuh lhuh peh un ahi. Ajona in Kir-hareseth leh asongbang ho bou akhen tauvin, ahin song septhem hon aumkimvel un anokhum tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Moab lengpan gal alel chu amudoh phat in chemjam lamthei cheh mi 700 toh Edom lengpa komlang chu phut vonga jamdoh agouvin ahileh ajou tapouvin ahi.  
\v 27 Hijou chun Moab lengpan achapa tahpen, ama khel a leng chang dingpa chu aman’in pal chunga chun kilhaina dingin atohdoh tan ahi. Hijeh chun Israel chungah lunghanna nasatah ahung chutan ahileh Israel te akinung heijun agamlang uvah akinungle tauvin ahi.   
\c 4  
\s1 Elisha’n Meithai Vaichanu Akithopi  
\p
\v 1 Nikhat chu themgao ho lah a khatpen ji ana hia meithai khat hi Elisha kom’ah ahungin ahung pengjah jengin, hitin aseiye, “Nangma noija na natong kajipa chu athitai, aman Pakai agin dan chu nangin nahet ahi. Ahinla tuhin sum kabatpa ahungin kacha teni hi soh a kai ding eigo tauvin ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 2 Hichun Elisha'n amanu kom’a chun, “Ipi kabolpeh thei um am? Nei seipeh in, na insung’a hi ipi naneijem?” ati.  
\p Amanun jong adonbut in, “Olive thao thei khat tilou imacha adang kaneipoi,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Elisha’n jong achutia ahileh “Na-insah na-inlhang hokom hihen, nagol napai hokom hijongleh belkeu namu thei chanin batnin gala tan.  
\v 4 Chujou teng chule nacha teni chutoh insungah lut unlang, kot kikha khum’un. Chutengleh Olive thao chu atheija kon chun bel keoho a chun sunglhauvin lang adim phatleh kaidohji jiuvin,” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Hichun amanun jong aseipeh bang-bang chun abol tan ahi. Amanun bel chu adim phat-phat leh acha tenin ahin pelutji lhon'in, hiti chun bel jouse chu adipsoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 6 Gangtah in Olive thaotwi koina ho jouse chu adim letset tan ahi!  
\p Amanun acha teni khat kom’a chun, “Bel khat neihin pehben,” atileh,  
\p aman, “aum tapoi!” ati. Hichun Olive thao jong chu abeitan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Amanun Pathen mipa kom’a chun thilsoh chu aseijin ahileh, aman amanu kom’a chun, “Tun Olive thao chu joh unlang nabat u chu sadoh tauvin chuleh nang le nacha teni avalla chu nakivah thei diu ahi,” ati.   
\s1 Elisha Le Shunem Akon Numeinu  
\p
\v 8 Nikhat hi Shunem khopi sunga chun Elisha agachen ahileh numei haotah khat ana chengin, amanu chun a inna anne dingin akouvin ahi. Hiche jou chun hilang chu ahopa chanin hilai mun achun anne dingin akinga jin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Amanun ajipa kom’a chun, “Ven, hilanga ahung chan le hung kingaji pa hi Pathen mitheng khat hitei din katahsan’e.  
\v 10 Hijeh chun ama ding hin inchunga hin indan khat sem hitin lupna khat, dokhang khat, touna khat le thaomei khat koipeh hite. Chutileh ahung kom leh mun anei thei ding ahi” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Nikhat hi Elisha chu Shunem inna chun ahung kile kit in, a inchung danna chun akal touvin akicholdo tan ahi.  
\v 12 Aman asohpa Gehazi kom’a chun, “Hiche Shunem numeinu kom’a khun thukhat kasei nom’e gatin,” ati. Ama ahung phat in,  
\v 13 Elisha’n Gehazi kom’ah “Amanu chu seipeh in hichan geija eikhohsa hi kakipah lheh jenge ipi kabolpeh ding ham? Lengpa kom’ah ahilouleh asepai lamkaipa kom’ah ipi seipeh leng adeijem?” ati.  
\p Hichun amanun adonbut in, “Ima ka ngaichapoi ka insung min eivetup nai,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Khonungin Elisha’n Gehazi chu adongin, “Amanu hi ipi ibolpeh thei ding ham?” ati. Gehazi'n adonbut in, “Amanu hin chapa aneipoi, ajipa jong atehse tai,” ati.   
\p
\v 15 “Ganung kou kit in” ati. Numeinu chu ahung kinungle in kotphunga adingin ahi.  
\v 16 “Khovei tuphat leh nangin na anga chapa khat nakipom ding ahi,” atipeh e.  
\p Amanun “Ahipoi, kapu! Pathen mipa nei joulhep hih in chuleh nei kimohnep sah hih in,” ati. \x + \xo 4:16 \xt Semtilbu 18:14\x*   
\p
\v 17 Ahinlah hiche numeinu chun nao ahin voptan ahi. Hiti chun akum kit in Elisha seibang bang chun cha pasal khat anei tan ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Hiche chapang chu ahung len jeptan ahileh apa chang-atna a chun akithopi dingin agachen ahi.  
\v 19 Pohphungin ahung peng jah jengin, “Kaluchang anai! Kaluchang anai,” ahin tin ahi.  
\p Apa chun asohte khat kom’a, “Inlang’a anu kom’a potauvin,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun asohpan jong in'ah apolut in ahileh anun jong aphei chung’ah apom’in ahi. Ahinla sun ahung hi phat in athitan ahi.  
\v 21 Amanun apo touvin Pathen mipa lupna chunga chun alupsah in kot akhah in, ahin dalha tan ahi.  
\v 22 Aman ajipa kom’ah thu athotnin, “Isohte hou khat pen-pen chu sangan khat toh hinsol’in hitia chu keima Pathen mipa kom’a chu kaga chea kahung kilekit loina dingin” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Amapan, “Tuni tah a hi ipi che ngaija ham? Tuni hi lhathah nikho golvah la ahipon, chuleh cholngahni lah ahipon,” ati.  
\p Ahinla amanun, “Akhohpoi, phanante” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Amanun jong sangan chungah chun apho akoidoh in, asohpa kom’a hitin aseijin, “Ken thu kapeh ngallou leh gangin noloijin” ati.   
\p
\v 25 Amanun Carmel Molla um Pathen mipa chu aphah kon'in Elisha chun galla kon'in amanu chu ahin mun Gehazi kom’a chun, “Ven, Shunem a kon'in numeinu ahung e.  
\v 26 Lhaijal inlang gadongin,” “Naji na cha toh naphat phat uhinam?” ati.  
\p Amanun Gehazi kom’ah, “Aphanai ima jouse aphanai.”   
\p
\v 27 Ahinlah amanu molchunga Pathen mipa kom ahung lhun phat in amu masanga tolla abohkhup in akeng chu atuh tan ahi. Gehazi chun amanu chu kaidoh agot leh Pathen mipan, “Suloh hih in, amanu hi lunggim'a ahin, Pakaijin keima ima eiseipeh hih laiye,” ati.   
\p
\v 28 Hichun amanun aseijin, “Hepu, nakom’a chapa dia kathum khah em?” Ken kasei louham, “Neiduha bol hih in chuleh nei kimoh nepsah hih in kati hilou ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 29 Chuin Elisha chun Gehazi kom’ah, “Gangtah in kigon lang kamol hi choi jinlang che loijin, lampia koimacha kom’a houlimpa hih in, cheloijin lang chapangpa mai’ah chun kamol hi gakoi loijin,” ati.   
\p
\v 30 Ahin chapangpa nu chun aseijin, “Hingjing Pakai leh nangma hinlaisen nangto ikilhon louding leh keima ka inna cheponge,” ati. Hichun Elijah toh ahung kilhon lhon tan ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Gehazi chu gangtah in ana che masan mol chu chapangpa chunga chun aga koiyin ahileh ima atipon ahi. Ahindoh dehlou jeh chun Elisha kom’ah ahung kilen, “Chapang chu ahingdoh dehpoi,” ahung ti in ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Elisha chu ahung lhun phat in, chapang chu athisa tahbeh in, themgaopa lupna a chun akijam nalaijin ahi.  
\v 33 Ama alutnin achangin kot akikha khum’in Pakai kom’ah ataovin ahi.  
\v 34 Hichun chapangpa chunga chun akijam in, amuh leh chapangpa muh asuto in, amit leh amit asuto in, akhut chu chapangpa khut chunga chun akoiyin ahi. Hiti chun chapangpa chunga chun akijam in ahileh chapangpa tahsa chu ahung lumdoh tan ahi! \x + \xo 4:34 \xt 1 Lgt 17:21\x*  
\v 35 Hiche phat chun, Elisha chu akithoudoh in indan sung’a chun avahle in, hijou chun chapang chunga chun alum kit in, hiche phat chun chapangpa chu sagi vei ahung chi in, chuin amit ahung hah tan ahi!   
\p
\v 36 Hijou chun Elisha’n Gehazi chu akouvin, “Chapangpa nu chu gakouvin!” ati. Amanu ahung lut phat in, na chapa hikom’a aum’e kilah tan ati.  
\v 37 Amanu chu akipah behseh jengin akengkhopi muh atuh in chibai aboh jeng tan ahi. Hijeh chun anao chu a-anga akipom’in akumsuh tan ahi.   
\s1 Kellhah Sung’a Elisha’n Thil Kidang Abol  
\p
\v 38 Elisha chu Gilgal langa ahung kile in ahileh gamsunga chun kel ana lhan ahi. Nikhat hi themgao phabep amasanga ana touvun ahileh aman jong asohpa Gehazi kom’ah aseijin, “Mei chunga chun bel lentah khat songin lang anchim lhah in ibonchauva ineh diuvin hin hon in,” ati.   
\p
\v 39 Gollhang ho lah a khat pen chu apotdoh in gamlah a hampa hollin ache in ahileh, gam umpong dimset in ahinpon ahung kile tan ahi. Aman ahal hallin athem lhan, nehthei lou thina thei ahilam helouvin bel sunga chun alhah tan ahi.  
\v 40 Anchim themkhat chu ahin hom’un khatvei nivei agah tepmun ahileh ahung peng jah jengun Pathen mipa anchim'a hin thina thei gu aum'e atiuvin anethei tapouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 41 Hichun Elisha’n jong “Changbong thamkhat hinchoijun,” ati. Ahin choi phat un aman bel sunga chun agah lhah in, “Tun aphatai, netauvin,” ati. Hichun imacha aphamo aum tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 42 Nikhat hi Baal-shalishah a kon'in mikhat ahungin Pathen mipa chu changhum bora khat leh changlhah pheng somni ahin pohpeh in ahi. Elisha’n, “Mipi ho chu peuvin nenau vinte,” ati.   
\p
\v 43 Asohpan jong an ahinsem in, “Hicheng seh a hi mihem jakhat jen iti kivah ding ham?” atin  
\p ahinlah Elisha’n ahin donbut in, “Mipi hon aneh diuvin pedoh un, ajeh chu Pakaijin aseije: Mijousen neuvin tin phabep val nalai ding ahi!” ati.  
\v 44 Hiti chun mipi ho chu apeuvin ahileh mijouse ding chun alhingsetnin Pakai thusei dungjuijin phabep jong ane val nalaijun ahi.   
\c 5  
\s1 Naaman Kiboldam  
\p
\v 1 Aram lengpa hin asepai lamkaipa Naaman hi ajabol lheh jengin ahi. Ajeh chu Pakaijin ama hi amangchan galjona thupi tah-tah ana pejin ahi. Ahinla Naaman hi mihangsan galsatje themtah anahi vangin, ama hi miphah ana hin ahi. \x + \xo 5:1 \xt Lk 4:27\x*   
\p
\v 2 Ama hin agalsatna a Israel gam hi ana delkhum’in gal-hing tamtah ahin mat lah ahin nungah chapang khat ana pang khan ahileh ajinu jen dingin ana pansah in ahi.  
\v 3 Nikhat hi hiche nungahnu hin apinu kom’a, “Kapupa hi Samaria um themgaopa khu gaki mupi leh aman aphah hi aboldam peh tei ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Hiche Israel a konna nungah chapangnu thusei chu Naaman hin lengpa kom’ah aga lhut tan ahi.  
\v 5 Aram lengpan, “Chenlang themgaopa chu gakimupi tan kenjong Israel lengpa kom’ah nang chung changah lekha thot nange,” ati. Hichun Naaman akipatdoh in kipa thilpeh dingin dangka pound 750, sana pound 150 chuleh pon hoitah tah jatsom akipoh in ahi.  
\v 6 Israel lengpa dinga alekhajih chun hitin aseijin ahi: “Hiche lekha pum'in ka lhachapa Naaman hi kahinsol'e ahithei leh aphahna hi hin boldam peh in,” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Hiche lekhathot hi Israel lengpan asimdoh phat chun avon abottel jengin, hitin aseitan ahi, “Hiche pa hin kakom’a miphah khat boldam dinga ahinsol hi kei Pathen kahi beh a, ken mihem kahinsah a kathisah thei beh ding ham? Ama hin kisatpi dinga eichouna ahi bouve,” ati tai.   
\p
\v 8 Ahinlah Pathen mipa Elisha chun Israel lengpan avon abotse jenge ti ajah phat chun hitin thu athot tan ahi, “Ibol'a lunghang’a nahim? Hiche Naaman chu keikom’ah hinsol tan chutileh aman Israel telah ahin themgao dihtah chu aum'e ti henante,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hichun Naaman chu asakolte toh akangtalai toh Elisha kotbullah angah tauve.  
\v 10 Ahinlah Elisha’n ama kom’a chun thu agah thot in, “Chenlang Jordan vadunga khun sagi vei gaki delut lechun navun chu hung kiledoh intin chuleh na phahna jong damdoh tan nate,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Ahinlah Naaman chu alunghang in, akihei mangin hitin aseije, “Keima geldanin ama hung potdoh intin, eiki mupi intin, ka phahna chungah hin akhut hin peilen tin, Pakai a Pathen min hinpan intin eidamsah ding ham kati ahi,” ati.  
\v 12 Hiche Israel te vadung ho jouse sanga hi Damascus a hung longlut Abana le Pharpar vadung teni hi phajo louding ong? Hichea chu kaki delut leh kadam jeng louding ong?” atin Naaman chu akihei mangin lunghang tah in achemang jeng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Ahinlah anoija asepai te chun hetthem sah tei agouvin hitin aseijun, “Hepu, themgaopa hin, thil hahsa khat tong dinga nasol leh ibola nabolda ding ham? Aman chenlang gakidelut in chutileh nadam ding ahi ati chu nabol jeng leh iti ham!” atiuvin ahi.  
\v 14 Hichun Naaman chu Jordan vadunga aga chesuh in themgaopan aseipeh bang-bang chun sagi vei aga kidelut in ahileh ahung damdoh in avou jong chapang voutoh abang jeng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Hijou chun Naaman le aloi ho cheng chu Pathen mipa kom’a dingin ahung kile tauvin ahi. Amaho amasanga adingun Naaman in hitin aseije, “Israel gam tilou vannoi leiset gam danga hin Pathen aumpoi ti kahe chentai, hijeh chun nasohpa a kon'in kipa thilpeh hi nei sanpeh tan,” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Ahin Elisha’n adonbut in, “Keiman kahou jing Pakai minna kasei ahi, keiman thilpeh imacha kilah ponge,” ati. Naaman in kilahsah tei agot vang'in Elisha anom pon ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hichun Naaman'in, “Aphai ahileh sakol ni poh khopset hiche leiset hi ka inlanga kipoh ingting tua pat in Pakai kom tilouvin semthu pathen dang kom’ah kilhaina gantha bol taponge.  
\v 18 Ahinla hiche thil khat chunga vang hin Pakaijin eingaidam hen. Hiche kapu lengpa hi Rimmon munna, milimdoi houva ache tengleh keima banjanga kingaiji ahin, keima jeng jong kabokhup teng Pakaijin nasohpa hi hiche thudolla hin eingaidam hen,” ati.   
\p
\v 19 Hichun Elisha’n ajah a “Lungmongin chetan” atin, Naaman in jong a inlang ajontai.   
\s1 Gehazi Duamna  
\p
\v 20 Ahinlah Pathen mipa Elisha sohpa Gehazi hi ama le ama akihouvin, “Kapupan Aram mipa thilpeh khatcha lalouva asoldoh jeng hi adihpoi, hingjing Pathen minna kasei ahi keiman del ing kating themkhat beh kalah ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 21 Hiti chun Gehazi hin Naaman nung adeltan ahi.  
\p Naaman in Gehazi in ahin nungdel chu amu phat in, asakol kangtalaija kon chun ahung kumlhan, “Ima jouse pha-pha a hinam?” ati.   
\p
\v 22 Gehazi in “Aphanai, Ephraim gam’a kon'in themgao gollhang ni tutah chun ahung lhon'in ahileh kapupan nakom’a eihinsol ahi. Aman dangka pound 75 leh pon hoi jatni hi amani peh dingin angaichan hijeh a chu eihin sol ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 Naaman in jong, “Dangka nasei jatni chu kilah in” atin, ponhoi jong jatni apen sum chu sakhaoni in achun in asohte mini achoisah in ahi.  
\v 24 Khopi chu alhun phat un Gehazin soh tenia kon chun thil chu alan amani alesol tan ahi. Hijou chun ama chan thil ho chu insunga asel tan ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Ama a Pakaipa kom'a agalut chun Elisha’n, “Gehazi hoiya nache ham?” ati.  
\p Aman “Hoikom'a kachepoi” ati.   
\p
\v 26 Ahinlah Elisha’n, “Naaman asakol kangtalaija konna ahung kumlhah a nakimuto lhonna chu keima lhagaova hiche kom’a chu kaum nahet louham? Hiche phat chu sum le pon kilah phat hija, Olive thingboh le lengpilei kilah phat hija, kelngoi le bongchal te kisan phat, soh pasal le soh numei tampi kisan phat mong hinam?” ati.  
\v 27 Hitobanga nachon jeh hin Naaman phahna hi nang le nason napah ho chunga atonsot geijin chuta hen,” ati. Gehazi chu indan sunga konna agah potdoh leh apum changin aphah in; avun jong buhbang bangin abang letlut jeng tan ahi.   
\c 6  
\s1 Elisha In Heichang Akiletdoh Sah  
\p
\v 1 Nikhat hi themgao honkhat Elisha kom’a ahung uvin hitin aseijuve, “Nangman nahet ma bang hin nang toh ikimuto nau mun hi aneo behseh jenge.  
\v 2 Jordan Vadung langa chesuh uhitin thing gatan uhitin ikikhop khomna diu munthah khat kisahdoh uhite,” ahung tiuve.  
\p Hichun aman adonbut in, “Aphai, nasei bangun bol uhite,” ati.   
\p
\v 3 Amaho lah a khat in atem’un, “Neihung kilhonpi uvin,” ati.  
\p Aman jong, “Hung nange,” ati.  
\v 4 Hichun Elisha jong amaho chutoh akilhon tan ahi.  
\p Jordan aga lhun phat un, ama hon thing akitan tauvin ahi.  
\v 5 Ahin amaho lah a khat chun thing atan pet in aheichang chu vadunga alhahsah tan ahi. Ama jong ahung peng jah jengin, “Vo, hepu! hiche heicha chu mi a kahin lah ahi,” ati.  
\v 6 Pathen mipan ahin seijin, “Hoilai donna nalhah sah ham?” ati. Aman jong amun avetsah phat chun Elisha’n molkhat alan amun laitah a chu aga kholut a ahileh heichang chu twichungah ahung kiletdoh tan ahi.  
\v 7 Hichun Elisha’n, “Kilah in,” ati. Hichun mipan asangin akimat tan ahi.   
\s1 Elisha Le Aram Mite  
\p
\v 8 Aram lengpa chu Israel te toh akisatto laitah chun, ama asepai lamkaite toh akihoutoh un hitin asei uve, “Eihon isepai teu chu hilai mun khat a ngahmun kisem ute akitiuve.”   
\p
\v 9 Ahinlah apettah chun Pathen mipa Elisha’n gangtah in Israel lengpa ana hilchah in, “Hichelai munna chun che hih un ajeh chu Aram ten asepai teu chu hilai munna chu changpang a ana um diu ahi,” atipeh tan ahi.  
\v 10 Hiti chun Israel lengpan Pathen mipan aseipehna mun mun’a chu asepai te asolji ahi. Kiging jing’a aum jing theina ding un, phatseh in Elisha’n Israel lengpa chu aseipeh jingin chule ana hilchah jingin ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Aram lenpa chu hiche chung chang’a hin, alunghang lheh jeng tan, hijeh chun aman anoija lamkai pipu ho chu akou khom’in hiti hin aseitan, “Koipen hi galmi langa pang naum uham? Koipen hin Israel lengpa hi kei tohgon ana seipeh jiuham?” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Hichun anoija lamkai pipuho khat in ahin donbut in, “Lengpa, ka pakai, keiho kahi pouve, Israel te lah a hin Elisha kiti themgao khat aumin, ama hin lengpa hi ijakai aseipehji ahi. Ama hin nachanga na jalkhunna naumpetna na thusei jouse jong hi ahet ahi,” atipeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Hichun lengpan thu ahin pen, “Cheuvin lang ama chu hoiya um’aham, gahe chen unlang keiman ama man ding chu ka sepai te kasol ding ahi,” ati. Hiti chun ama hon jong aga hetoh un,  
\p “Ama hi Dothan a aum'e,” tin ahung seipeh tauvin ahi.  
\v 14 Hichun Aram lengpan hiche khopi sung um dingin sepai tamtah leh sakol kangtalai tamtah asol tan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Pathen mipa sohpa chu jingpitah in ahung thouvin, pam lang aga potdoh leh sepai tamtah leh sakol kangtalai tamtah muntin’ah amutan ahileh, Elisha kom’a chun, “O, hepu, i-iti ding hitam?” tin apeng jah jengin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Elisha’n ama kom’ah, “Kicha hih in, amaho sangin eini panpiho atamjo uve,” ati.  
\v 17 Hijou chun Elisha jong ataovin, “O Pakai, amit hin hadohsah inlang, hin musah tan,” tin ataovin ahileh, Pakaijin gollhangpa mit chu ahadohsah tan ahileh Elisha vella molpang ho chu sakolte le akangtalai ho meikongin atom ana dimset in ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Aram sepai te chu Elisha man ding’a ahungsuh phat uchun, Elisha ataovin, “O Pakai amaho hi amit u suhchot pehtan,” atin ahileh Elisha’n angeh bang bangin Pakaijin amit u asuhchot pehtan ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hichun Elisha apotdoh in amaho kom’a chun, “Nahung nau hi adih tapoi hiche hi nahol u khopi chu ahipoi, neihin juijun, keiman nahol nau kom’a chun napuilut nauvinge” ati. Hiti chun amaho chu Samaria khopia chun apuilut tan ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Samaria khopi chu alhun phat un, Elisha ataovin, “O Pakai tun amit u hasah kit inlang kho musah tan,” ati. Hiti chun Pakaijin amit u ahasah in ahileh amaho Samaria khopi alailunga um ahiu akimudoh tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Israel lengpan amaho chu amudoh phat in Elisha kom’a chun ahin samjah jengin, “Hepa, hiche ho hi ka thagam ding hitam? Ka thagam ding hitam?” ahintin ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Elisha’n ahin donbut in, “Natha thei louding ahi! Gal-hing’a kiman ho hi kithatji ngai em? Aneh diu le adon diu joh pen lang aputeu kom langa nungsol tauvin,” ati.   
\p
\v 23 Hiti chun lengpan ankong thupitah ahin sem’in, anehsah in, apupau kom langa alesol tauvin ahi. Hichejou chun Aram gal miten Israel gam ahin nokhum tapouvin ahi.   
\s1 Samaria Khopi Aram Ten Aumkhum'u  
\p
\v 24 Ahin phat chomkhat set jou hin Aram lengpa Ben-Hadad in agal mite jouse atit khom’in Samaria khopi ahin umkhum tauvin ahi.  
\v 25 Hijeh chun khopi sunga chun kellhahna nasatah aum tan ahi. Khopi aumkhum nau chu asot lheh jengtan ahileh sangan luchang khat chu dangka somget in akijoh in, gam louthul til jeng jong atena khat hoplia hopkhatna chu dangka nga in akijoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Nikhat hi Israel lengpa chu khopi pal chunga chun avahlelen ahileh numei khat in ahin kouvin, “Kapu lengpa, lungset tah in nei kithopin,” ahin tin ahi.   
\p
\v 27 Chuin aman adonbut in, “Pakaijin nakithopi louleh keiman ipi kabolpeh thei ding ham? Keiman changvohna pholla kon'in chang la kanei tapon, lengpitwi jong aheh lhahna a kon'in kanei tapon hoiya ipi kalah a nang kapeh ding ham?” ati.  
\v 28 Ahin lengpan adongin “Ipi ham na hahsatna,” tin adongin ahileh  
\p amanun adonbut in, “Hiche numeinu hi kakom’ah ahungin tunin nang chapa chu nehitin jingleh kei chapa nena hite atin,” ahi.  
\v 29 Hijeh chun kei chapa kakihon lhon'in kane lhontai, ajingin ama chapa kitha hitin neta hite kati leh aman akisel mangtai,” ati. \x + \xo 6:29 \xt Danbu Ni Na 28:57; Ka La 4:10\x*   
\p
\v 30 Hichun Lengpan hiche thu hi ajah doh phat in lunghangtah in apon abottel jengin ahi. Hitia chu lengpa pal chunga avalena a chun mipi hon khaodip pon akisil chu amu uvin ahi.  
\v 31 Lengpa apengjah jengin, “Tuni tah a hi Elisha luchang katan louleh Pathen’in keima eithat jenghen” tin akihahsel jah jengtan ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Hitia chu lengpan akou dia mi asol chun, Elisha chu Israel upaho toh a insungah ana toukhom’un, akoupa chu ahunglhun masang'in Elisha’n upaho jah achun, “Hiche tolthat pa khun kei loltan dingin mikhat ahin sol in ahi. Ama ahunglhun tengleh kot kamkhum'un hin lutsah hih un, ama nunga apupan ahin juipai ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 33 Elisha’n hitia thu asei jinglai chun thupole pa chu ahunglhung paitan, chule lengpa chun asei paijin, “Hiche lungkhamna ho jouse hi Pakaiya kon ahi, chuti ahileh ken Pakai chu iti kanga jing nahlai ding ham?” ati.   
\c 7  
\p
\v 1 Elisha’n adonbut in, “Pakai thupeh ngaijin! Pakaijin hitin aseije: Tuphat don jing tengleh Samaria thil kijohna mun’ah antuitah atena dim khat chu dangka khatna kijoh ding, sakol chaang atena dim ni jong dangka khat dinga hung kijoh ding ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 2 Hichun lengpa kithopi jing asepai lamkaipa chun Pathen mipa jah a chun, “Pakai ama tah in van a konna van bangkot ahondoh a, hitobang thil chu abol ding hijongleh hithei mong ding hinam?” ati.  
\p Ahinlah Elisha’n jong adonbut in, “Athilsoh ho chu namit tah a vang namu ding ahin, khatcha naneh khah louding ahi,” atipeh tan ahi.   
\s1 Aphah Hon Gal Mite Ngahmun Agavil'u  
\p
\v 3 Tun khopi kelkot lutna kom’ah miphah li anaum uvin ahi. Amaho chu khat le khat akidongto uvin, “Eiho hi thi ngah mai maija ihiti tou thim jing diu hitam?” akitiuvin ahi.  
\v 4 “Eiho hitia hi ium uleh anngol’a ithi tei diu ahi, khopi sunga lut jong leuhen kel-khoh jeh a ithi thou-thou diu ahi. Hijeh chun Aram sepai te kom’a kipelut jeng leuhen eihing hoi maitheiju ahi, ijemtia eitha jengu jongleh ithi thou-thou diu ahin, hichu phajolou ham?” akitiuve.   
\p
\v 5 Hiti chun jingpi phalvah-in amaho Aram ngahmun ah alut tauvin ahi. Hitia chu angah munna agalut uleh koimacha ana umpon ahi!  
\v 6 Ajeh chu Pathen’in sakol lhaigin leh sakol kangtalai lhaigin chule sepai tamtah hung lhailut gin akithonsah in ahileh Israel lengpa hin, “Hit mite le Egypt mite akikou uva eihin nokhum'u ahitai,” atiuva kap le penga jammang gam'a ahi tauve.  
\v 7 Hijeh a chu kicha behseh uva aponbuh u, asakol teu, asangan teu chuleh athil dang hou jouse adalhah uva ahinkhou kihuhhingna dinga ana jamdoh gam’ah ahi tauve.   
\p
\v 8 Miphah ho chu ponbuh sung khatna alut un chuleh khat ah alut un aneuvin adon’un, sana dangka leh ponho akichom’un akisel’un ahi.  
\v 9 Ajonan amaho akihouvun, “Ibol uhi adih tapoi, tuni hi nikhopha khat ahi bouve, hiche hi eiho mitoh ichankhom lou uhi adihpoi, eihon hitia hi jing geija ichepiuva ahileh hamsetna itotei diu ahi. Hijeh chun hung’un eiho cheu hitin lengte khopi sunga miho gahetsah uhite,” akitiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hiti chun amaho acheuvin khopi sunga kelkot ngah ho chu thilsoh ho aga hetsah tauvin ahi. “Keiho Aram mite ngahmun na kalut un ahile koimacha anaum tapon ahi! Sakol ho leh Sangan ho ana kihen nalaijin, ponbuh ho jong abang bangin ana um’in, mihem koimacha anaum tapon ahi,” atiuve.  
\v 11 Hichun kelkot ngahho chun khopi sunga mipi ho lah a chun hasap in asamphong tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Israel ten Ngahmun Achom'u  
\p
\v 12 Lengpa chu jan khangkim in alupna a kon'in ahung thoudoh in, anoija lamkai pipuiho kom’a chun hitin aseitan ahi, “Keiman thilsoh ho hi kahei, Aram mite hin eiho anngol'a ium uhi ahet u ahin, hijeh a chu angahmun u adalhah uva gamlah a gakisel’ah ahiuve. Amaho hin khopi idalhah uva ipotdoh tengu leh eiho hi ahinga matna khopi chu lonkhum ding atiu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Anoija lamkai holah a khat chun ahin donbut in, “Ipi hileh eihon gakholtoh pou-pou uhite. Sakol athimoh nga ho khu mangchau hitin akholtoh ding sol uhite. Ijemtia achung uva thil khat ahungso tah jongleh, hilai mun ah umjong leu eiho chengto ithikhom thou-thou diu ahin, akhoh dehpoi,” ahin tin ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Hiti chun sakol kangtalai ni chu agongun lengpan Aram sepai te chunga thilsoh chu gakhol toh dingin asol tauvin ahi.  
\v 15 Amaho Jordan vadung geijin acheuvin Aram sepai te ponho, manchahho ajamcheh nauva apai thanghou chu aga mu uvin ahung kile un, lengpa kom’a asei tauvin ahi.  
\v 16 Hijou chun Samaria khopi miho chu alhaidoh un, Aram te ngahmun chu agachom tauvin ahi. Hiti chun antui tah-tah atena dim nga chu dangka khat aman’in chuleh sakol chang atena dim som chu dangka khat aman’in, Pakaijin ana tep bang-bang chun akijoh tan ahi.  
\v 17 Lengpan a sepai lamkaipa chu kelkot a mipi ting ding chun ana pansah in ahileh mipi hon anolhu uvin, achonlih tauvin ahi.  
\p Hiti chun Pathen mipan ain'a hung lengpa kom’a ana phondoh tobang bang chun ana sohdoh tan ahi.  
\v 18 Pathen mipan lengpa koma chun, “Jing nikho tuphat dontah leh antui tah atena dim nga chu dangka khatna kicho ding chuleh sakol chang atena dim som chu dangka khatna kicho ding,” anati ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hiche pettah a chu lengpa noija sepai lamkai pa chun, “Pakaijin vanna van bangkot jouse ahon lhah ding hijongleh hithei ponte anati!,” ahileh, Pathen mipa chun, “Nangin thilsoh chu na mittah a namu ding amavang naneh man tahlou ding ahi!” anati.  
\v 20 Chutobang chun anasoh tai, ajeh chu mipi hon ama chu kotphunga chun ana chonlih tauvin ahi!   
\c 8  
\s1 Shunem Khoa Numeinu Hung Kile Kit  
\p
\v 1 Elisha’n achapa thisa ahindohsah peh numeinu kom’a chun hitin ana seijin ahi, “Na insung mite kipuijin lang mun dang khatna chetan ajeh chu Pakaijin Israel chunga kum sagi kel alhahsah ding ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 8:1 \xt 2 Lengte 4:8-37\x*  
\v 2 Hijeh chun Pathen mipan asei bang-bangin numeinu chun aboltan ahi. Amanun a insung mite apuidoh in Philistine gam’ah kum sagi aga cheng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Kellhah akichai jouvin Philistine gam’a kon'in a inlam'ah ahung kile kit tan ahi. Ain leh agam nungmu kitna dingin lengpa kom’ah achen ahi.  
\v 4 Hitia chu amanu lengpa kom’a agalut chun, lengpa chu Pathen mipa sohpa Gehazi chutoh ana kihoulim pet ahin, lengpa chun Gehazi kom’a chun, “Elisha thilbol kidang ho phabep nei seipeh in,” anatin ahi.  
\v 5 Chule Gehazi chun, Elisha in chapang thisa khat ahindoh sah kit thu chu ana seipeh in ahi. Hiche pet tah chun, hiche chapangpa nu chu lengpa kom’a a-in le agam thua tiemna nei dingin ahunglut in ahi.  
\p “Ven, lengpa ka pakai!” tin Gehazi in asam'in, “Numeinu chu hicheva aum'e, chule hiche hi achapa ahi—Elisha'n ahinsah kit chu!” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Lengpan numeinu chu adongin, “Hichu dih hinam?” ati. Hichun amanun athusim chu aseipeh tai. Chuin lengpa noija natong pipuiho khat chu akouvin numeinu thil le lo ho chu ale chan kitna dinga agontoh peh dingin anganse tan ahi.   
\s1 Hazael In Ben-Hadad Atha  
\p
\v 7 Elisha chu Ben-Hadad damlouva alupna Aram khopi Damascus a chun achen ahi. Mikhat in lengpa kom’a chun Pathen mipa ahunge tia aseipeh phat chun,  
\v 8 Lengpan Hazael kom’a chun, “Kipa thilpeh khat chu choijinlang Pathen mipa chu gapenlang, chule hiche ka natna a konna hi ka damdoh ding hinam? Pakai chu eidoh peh tan,” tin asol'in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hiti chun Hazael chun sangonsang somli chu Damascus a thilsoh phapen ho chutoh, Elisha kom’a achen, hitin aseitan ahi, “Nasohpa Ben-Hadad Aram lengpan nangkom’a eihinsol ahi chule hiche kanatna a konna hi kadamdoh ding hinam? tin eiga dohpeh in atia eihinsol ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 10 Elisha'n adonbut in, “Chenlang hiti hin gaseipeh tan, nangma na damdoh tei ding ahi, tihi Pakaijin atahbeh in eimusah in ahi, amavang thitei ding ahi!” ati.  
\v 11 Hichun Elisha’n Hazael chun nommo asah tokah sen mitlha louhellin avechang mellin, chujouvin Pathen mipa chu ahung kaplha jeng tan ahi.   
\p
\v 12 “Ipithu hitam, kapu?” tin, Hazael’in adongin ahi.  
\p Elisha'n adonbut in, “Nangman Israel te chunga tijat um tahtah thil ho hi nahin bol ding kahen ahi. Nangin kul kiget khum akhopi hou nahin hallhah ding, agollhang hou chemjam'a nahin ban satlih gam ding, achapang teu toltoh nahin chotnat ding, anumei hou agailai nahin khojal ding hi kahe in ahi!” ati.  
\v 13 Hazael'in adonbut in, “Kei tobang imacha hilou khat mai maijin chutobang thil nasa chu katoh thei ding ham?” ati. Ahin Elisha’n adonbut in, “Pakaijin eimusah in nangma hi Aram leng nahung hi ding ahi,” ati. \x + \xo 8:13 \xt 1 Lgt 19:15\x*   
\p
\v 14 Hazael in Elisha adalhan lengpa kom'ah akile kittan ahi, hichun lengpa jong ama kom'a chun, “Elisha ipi nahin seipeh em?” tin ana dongin ahi.  
\p Hazael in adonbut in, “Nangma hi na damdoh tei ding ahi tin aman eiseipeh e.” ati.   
\p
\v 15 Ahinlah ajing nikhon Hazael in ponlum twiya asukot in amai akhun athi tokah in amai ah akhuden pehtan ahi. Hijou chun Hazael chu Aram te leng ahung hitan ahi.   
\s1 Jehoram In Judah Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 16 Israel lengpa Ahab chapa Joram vaihom kum nga channa in Judah te leng Jehoshaphat chapa Jehoram min Judah te chunga vai ana homin ahi.  
\v 17 Jehoram hi leng ahung hichun ama kum somthum le ni ana lhingtan ama hin Jerusalem mah kum get lengvai anapon ahi.  
\v 18 Jehoram hin Israel lengte chonchan ajuijin Ahab lengpa phatmo tobangin aphamon ahi. Ajeh chu aman Ahab chanu ho lah a khat ana kichenpin ahi. Hiti chun Jehoram hin Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin ahi.  
\v 19 Ahinlah Pakaijin Judah mite ana sumang nompon ahi, ajeh chu aman David toh kitepna ana neijin achilhah ten vai ahopjom ding chule a-itih a thaomei banga vahjing dinga ana teppeh ahi. \x + \xo 8:19 \xt 1 Lgt 11:36\x*   
\p
\v 20 Jehoram vaihom sungin, Edom ten Judah dounan gal ahin bollun, leng atum’in ahin kitundoh tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 8:20 \xt Semtilbu 27:40\x*  
\v 21 Hichun Jehoram in asakol kangtalai chengse chutoh akonun Zair khopi aga nokhum tauvin ahi. Ahin Edom miten asakol kangtalai chule gal lamkaiho chu ahin umkhum tauvin ahileh ama jong jan noiya chun apotdoh in amaho chu jan muthim noija chun adelkhum'in ahi. Ahinlah Jehoram chu asepai ten ajam sannun a inlam uvah ana jamsan tauvin ahi.  
\v 22 Hiti hin Edom miten tuni chan geiyin Judah a kon'in chamlhatna ana mutauvin ahi. Libnah khopi injong hiche phat sunga chun kiphinna ahin neijun ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Jehoram vaihom sunga thilsoh ho leh anatoh dohho jouse \it Judah Lengte Thusim bu\it*a akijihlut sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 24 Jehoram athi phat chun, David khopia apu apate toh akivui khom’in ahi.   
\s1 Ahaziah In Judah Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 25 Ahab chapa Joram leng vaipoh kumsom le ni channa ahin, Jehoram chapa Ahaziah hin Judah chungah lengvai anapo in ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Ahaziah hi leng ahung chan chun ama kum somni le ni alhingin chuleh ama hin, Jerusalem ah kum khat vai ana hom’in ahi. Anu chu Israel leng Omri tunu Athaliah ahi.  
\v 27 Ahaziah chun Ahab lengpa insung mite chondan dihlou chu ana juijin ahi. Aman Pakai mitmu’n thil phalou ngen ana bollin ahi. Ajeh chu aman Ahab insung ana kichenpi in ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Ahaziah hin Israel lengpa Ahab chapa Joram chu Ramoth-gilead munnah Aram lengpa Hazael toh kisat dingin ana pan khompi in ahi. Aram ten Joram lengpa chu gal kisatna munnah ana kisuhkhah jeh chun,  
\v 29 Jezreel langah akisuh khahna a adamna dingin ana kinunglen, Ramoth kho ah ana lamto un ahi. Hitia chu Joram ana kisuhkhah jeh in, Judah lengpa Ahaziah chu ama vedingin Jezreel langa ana chen ahi.   
\c 9  
\s1 Israel Leng Dia Jehu Thao Kinu  
\p
\v 1 Alangkhat ah Elisha themgaovin thempu kiloikhom ho lah a mikhat chu akouvin ama kom’a chun, “Kholjin din kigon chuleh Olive thao bom khat kichoijin lang Ramoth-gilead langa chen,  
\v 2 hichea chun Nimshi chapa Jehoshaphat chapa Jehu chu gaholdoh inlang aloiho lah a kon'in indan sungnung khatna koulut in,  
\v 3 chule aluchungah thao nunlang, hiti hin seipeh in, ‘Pakaijin hiti hin aseije: Nang hi Israel te chunga leng dinga thao kanu nahitai.’ Chujou tengleh kot hong inlang na hinkho huhnan jamdoh loi jengin, tin aseije!” ati.   
\p
\v 4 Hiti chun themgao gollhangpa chun akiseipeh bang bangin Ramoth Gilead lam’ah achetan ahi.  
\v 5 Ama hiche mun agalhun chun, Jehu chu sepai lamkai dang hotoh ana toukhompet un agamudoh in ahi. Hichun aman jong, “Keiman nang dingin thupeh khat kahinpoi,” ati.  
\p “Keiho koipen dingin em?” tin Jehu chun ahin dongin ahi.  
\p “Lamkaipu, nang ding ahi,” tin adonbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Hichun Jehu’n adang ho chu ahin dalhan insunga chun aluttan ahi. Hichun themgao gollhangpa chun Jehu luchunga chun thao asunglhan, hiti hin aseipeh tai, “Hiche hi Pakai Israel Pathen'in asei ahi: Keiman Pakai mite, Israel chunga leng ding’a thao kanu ahi. \x + \xo 9:6 \xt 1 Lgt 19:16\x*  
\v 7 Nangin napupa insung mite na suhmang ding hitia chu keiman Jezebel in kathemgao ho leh Pakai sohte athagamna phu chu kalah ding ahi.  
\v 8 Ahab insung mite jouse natha gam sohhel ding ahi. Keiman achilhah pasal jouse, asohte le asoh hilou pasal jouse Israel te chenna muntinna ka suhmang ding ahi.  
\v 9 Keiman Nebat chapa Jeroboam insung leh Ahijah chapa Baasha insung ka suhmang banga Ahab insung jong ka suhmang ding ahi.  
\v 10 Jezreel munna gambeh khatna Ahab jinu Jezebel chu uicha in aneh ding koiman amanu chu avuilou ding’u ahi,” ati. Chuin khangdong themgao pan kot chu ahongin ajamtan ahi. \x + \xo 9:10 \xt 1 Lgt 21:23\x*   
\p
\v 11 Jehu chu asepai lamkaiho kom’a ahung kinungle kit in ahile amaho lah a mikhat chun adongin, “Hiche mingolpa chun ipi adei ham? Aphamo umlouva hinam?” ati.  
\p Jehu’n adonbut in “Hitobang miho thusei ding chu nahetsao hichula,” ati.   
\p
\v 12 Amahon, “Nangin thil khat na im'e, nei seipeh un,” atiuvin ahi.  
\p Hichun Jehu’n amaho chu aseipeh un, “Aman kakom’ah Pakaijin hitin aseije: 'Keiman nangma hi Israel te chunga leng dinga thao kanu nahitai,'” ati.   
\p
\v 13 Hichun ama hon akengtonoi uvah pon aphauvin kelchal ki amut un, “Jehu leng ahitai!” atiuve.   
\s1 Jehu In Joram Le Ahaziah Atha  
\p
\v 14 Nimshi chapa Jehoshaphat chapa Jehu chun Joram lengpa dounan gal aboltan ahi. (Joram hi Ramoth-gilead munna Israel te huhna dia Aram lengpa Hazael sepai te toh kidouva uma ahi.  
\v 15 Ahinlah Joram lengpa chu gal kisatna a ana kisukha in, akisuhkhahna ho kijen dam dingin Jezreel a kinunglea ahi.) Hichun Jehu in akinaipi ho kom’a chun, “Nanghon leng dinga neidei uleh keiman thilsoh ho hi Jezreel a miho agahet sah louna diuvin hiche khopia kon'in koima potsah tahih un,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Hijou chun Jehu chu asakol kangtalai achun atouvin Jezreel munna damlouva kijen a um Joram kimutopi dingin achetan ahi. Judah lengpa Ahaziah jong hiche munna chu Joram vedinga ana che ahi.  
\v 17 Jezreel kulpi chunga khosatna a kon'in khongahpan Jehu le aloiho ahungu chu agalmun, Joram kom’a chun ahin sam'in, “Keiman sepai honkhat ahung kamun ahi!” ati.  
\p Hichun Joram lengpan thu apen, “Sakol chung toukhat soldoh inlang chamna thudol'a hung hinauvem gadohsah in,” ati.   
\p
\v 18 Hichun sakol toukhat alhaidoh in Jehu kom'a chun aga dongin “Lengpan chamna thudol'a nahung hinam ti ahenom’e,” agati.  
\p Jehu’n adonbut in, “Chamna chu ipi ding nati ham? Neihin juitan!” ati.  
\p Hichun khongah pan Joram lengpa kom’a chun, “Sottol pa chun amaho akimupin ahung kile tapoi,” tin aseipeh tai.   
\p
\v 19 Hichun lengpan sakol chunga tou ani channa asoldoh kit in, ama chun akom uva, “Lengpan chamna thudol'a nahung u hinam ahenom e,” tin aga dong'e.  
\p Jehu’n adonbut in, “Chamna ipi ding nati ham? Neihin juitan,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun khongahpa chun ahin sam’in, “Sottolpa chun amaho akimupin ahinla ama ahung kile tapoi! Ahunga khu Nimshi chapa Jehu toh abange, asakol tildan khu aham vevu jenge,” ati.   
\p
\v 21 Hichun Joram lengpan thu apen “Gang in! Ka sakol kangtalai chu gotsan koiyin!” ati.  
\p Hiche jou chun Israel lengpa Joram leh Judah lengpa Ahaziah chu Jehu toh kimuto dingin asakol kangtalai chungah ahung kijot doh lhon'in ahi. Amanin Jezreel munna Neboth gam munna chun agakimupi lhon tan ahi.  
\v 22 Joram lengpa in adongin, “Jehu, chamna thudol'a nahung hinam?” ati.  
\p Jehu’n, “Nanu Jezebel semthu pathen houna ho leh doithu sapna in hon eium kimvel laiseuva hoilang chamna iti um thei ding ham?” tin ana donbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hichun Joram lengpan sakol ale heijin ajam'in, Ahaziah lengpa kom’ah “Leng mun chu ahi, Ahaziah!” atin ahi.  
\v 24 Ahin Jehu chun, athalpi a agah kap a ahileh, athalpi chang chu Joram lengkou teni kikah a alut in, hiche thalchang chun alungchangtah akhan asakol kangtalai chung’a chun alhu lhop in, athiden tan ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Chuin Jehu chun anoija pipu pa, Bidkar kom’a chun, “Atahsa chu Jezreel a Naboth gamkai sunga chun lehlut tan. Apa Ahab nunga Sakol a ina lhailai chu nagel doh em? Pakaijin ama douna a hitia hi ana phondohsa ahitai:  
\v 26 'Janhia Naboth le achate atha kamitchang tah a kamu ahi, hiche gambeh chunga hi keiman aphu kalah ding ahi tin Pakai akihahsel in ahi.' Hijeh chun Pakaijin aseibang bangin Naboth gamsung a chun lehlut tan,” ati. \x + \xo 9:26 \xt 1 Lgt 21:19\x*   
\p
\v 27 Chuin Judah lengpa Ahaziah in thilsoh amu phat in, ama jong Beth-haggan lamlen langa ajamtan ahi. Ahin Jehu’n ama chu adellin, “Ama jong kaplih un!” ati. Hiti chun ama hon jong Ahaziah chu Ibleam kom'a um Gur lang kaltouna laitah a chun ana kaplhu un, ahin Megiddo geijin ana jam phei peh in, hikom'a chun ana thiden tan ahi.  
\v 28 Asohten athilong chu asakol kangtalai in apouvin, Jerusalem alhut un David khopia apu apate kivuina a avui tauvin ahi.  
\v 29 Ahab chapa Joram leng vaipoh kal kum som le khat lhin kum chun Ahaziah chu Judah chunga leng ana chang in ahi.   
\s1 Jezebel Thi Umchan  
\p
\v 30 Chuin Lengpa nu Jezebel chun Jehu chu Jezreel ah ahunge tithu ajah phat chun amit teni ajem hoisel in, asam akipojolsel in, bangkot achun atouvin ahi.  
\v 31 Jehu chu khopi kelkot ahunglut jou chun, amanun jong hasap in ahinsam in, “Tolthatpa chamna thudol'a hung nahi hinai mo? Apupa Zimri thatpa tobang nahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 32 Jehu chun chunglang agahvet leh bangkot a chun amanu agah mun, hitin asam in ahi, “Keilam a panga koi-koi nahiuvem?” tia agah sap le, nukiso mini le thum'in ahin veuvin ahi.  
\v 33 Hichun Jehu’n jong, “Amanu chu hinsep lhauvin,” atin ahileh amanu chu bangkot a kon'in ahin sonlhauvin, athisan chu bang leh sakol chungah chun akithe tho jengin ahi. Jehu’n atouna sakol kengto ah achil'in ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Chuin Jehu chu khopi sunga alut’in, ane'n adon’in ahi. Hiche jou chun, “Khattou cheuvin lang sapset chang hiche numei nu hi gavui tauvin, ajeh chu ama hi leng chanu ahi,” ati.  
\v 35 Ahin amaho chu avui ding’a achedoh uleh, ama hon, alugu, akeng chuleh akhut teni tilou adang amu tapouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Chuin amaho ahung kile uvin Jehu kom’a aseijun ahileh aman, “Pakaijin Tishbe khoa alhachapa Elijah kom’a anasei chu guilhung ahitai, 'Jezreel khosung’a Jezebel tahsa hi uichan aneh ding ahi. \x + \xo 9:36 \xt 1 Lgt 21:23\x*  
\v 37 Chujongleh Jezebel tahsa chu Jezreel khosung’a chu jun le eh banga kithe cheh ding, koima chan hiche hi Jezebel kitinu chu ahi tia ahetdoh lou ding’u ahi,'” ati.   
\c 10  
\s1 Jehu’n Ahab Insung Mite Jouse Asuhgam  
\p
\v 1 Ahab in chapa somsagi aneijin amaho chu Samaria khopi sunga achengun ahi. Hichun Jehu in Samaria khopi sunga upaho le lamkai pipu hokom leh Ahab chate chingtup ho kom'ah lekha anathot in hitin aseije,  
\v 2 “Leng chate chu nakom uvah aum’in, chule sakol kangtalai ho leh sakol ho chujongleh kul kigetkhum khopi le manchah ho jong nangho khutna aum’in ahi. Hiche lekha hi namu phat-phat uleh,  
\v 3 napu chapa te lah a chun alolhing pentah khat na lengpa diuvin lhengdoh uvin lang chutengleh, Ahab son le pahte huhna a galsat dingin ana kigongun,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Ahinlah amaho kichatna adim jeng tauvin, “Hiche pa masanga hin lengni ana ding joupoi ti eihon iheuvin ahi! Achutia ahileh eihon ipi ibol thei diu ham?” akitiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Hijeh chun, leng inpi leh khopi sunga vaihom ho leh upaho, chuleh lengpa chapa te vesuiya panghon Jehu kom’ah hitin lekha ana thot un ahi: “Keiho hi nasohte kahiuvin nangin bollin nati tichu bolding kahiuve. Keihon leng dingin koima lheng pouvinge. Ipi hijongleh nangin aphapen dia nagel chu bol jengin,” atiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Jehu’n ani channa in adonbutna lekha athotnin: “Nangho kei langa napan uva, kathu nangai diu leh napupau chapa te luchangho chu Jezreel mun’ah jing tuphat donleh hinpouvin,” atin ahi. Hiche leng chapa te somsagi ho hi aneolai uva patna Samaria lamkai ho hin kahin khoukhah u ahi  
\v 7 Hiche lekha chu ahung lhun phat in leng chapa te somsagi ho chu lamkai hon athat tauvin ahi. Ama hon aluchangu chu pocha sunga aheng’un, Jezreel munna Jehu kom’a chun ahin pelut tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Sottole ho lah a khat chu, “Leng chapa te luchang chu ahinpo tauve,” tin Jehu kom'a ahung seitauve. Jehu’n thu apen, “Lhuhni in se uvin lang khopi lutna kelkot achun koi unlang jingkah hunglhun tokah in hilaiya chun dalha tauvin,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Ajing nikho jingkah in ama apotdoh in avel'a hung kikhom mipi ho lah a chun ahoulim in, aman amaho kom’a chun, “Nangho koima chan thepmona nanei pouve, kapupa douna a thil gong le athat a chu keima kahi. Ahinlah amaho cheng hi koitha hija ham?,” atin ahi.  
\v 10 “Pakaijin Ahab insung mite chung chang ana phondoh ho chu guilhung tei ding ahi ti nang hon naheuve. Pakaijin asohpa Elijah mangcha a hiche thilsoh ding hi ana phondohsa ahitai,” ati.  
\v 11 Hijou chun Jehu in Jezreel sunga cheng Ahab insung mite jouse, anoija natong lamkai pipuiho jouse, aman ana kigolngaipi leh athempu ho jouse athatgam sohkei tan ahi. Hiti chun Ahab kitipa hi ason apah khatcha ahingah aum tapon ahi. \x + \xo 10:11 \xt Hosea 1:4\x*   
\p
\v 12 Hiche jou hin Jehu chun Samaria lang ana jontan ahi. Aman akalsonna ah kelngoi chingho Beth-eked munnah,  
\v 13 Judah lengpa Ahaziah insung mite toh akimuto uvin, aman, “Koi nahiuvem?” tin adongin ahi.  
\p Ama adonbut un, “Keiho hi Leng Ahaziah sopi te ho kahiuve. Ahab Lengpa chapa te ho leh lengpa anu chapa te ho villa kahungu ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 14 Hichun Jehu’n asepai te kom’a chun asam'in, “Ahingin man'un!” ati. Chuin ama hon mi somli le ni chu aman'un Beth-eked twikul munna chun athatgam tauve. Khatcha jong ana hinghoi pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Jehu in hilai mun chu adalhah phat in, Recab chapa Jehonadab chun ahung kimupin ahi. Amani akichibai jou lhon'in Jehu in akom’ah, “Keima nang kom’a kakitah banga nang jong kei kom’a nakitah hinam?” tin adongin ahi.  
\p Jehonadab in jong, “Kakitahnai,” tin adonbut e.  
\p “Chuti ahileh nakhut neihin pen,” ati. Hijeh chun Jehonabab in jong akhut ahinpen ahileh Jehu in jong asakol kangtalai chungah agah kaidoh in ahi.  
\v 16 Jehu in akom’a aseijin, “Tun hungin Pakaiya katomngaina hung vetan,” ati. Hiti chun Jehonadab toh akilhon khom tan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Jehu Samaria agalhun phat in, Ahab insungmi amoh anaum nalai ho chu Pakaijin Elijah themgao mangcha’a ana kitepna dungjuijin abonchan athat sohkeijin ahi.   
\s1 Jehu In Baal Thempuho Atha  
\p
\v 18 Hijou chun khopi sunga mipi ho jouse chu akou khom’in ajah uvah, “Ahab in Baal doi ana hou chutoh keiman kahou dan imacha tekah thei ahipoi!  
\v 19 Hijeh chun, Baal doi hou ho leh thempuho chuleh themgaoho akoukhom sohkeiyun ahi. Baal hou jouse chu hungsoh nauvem veuvin, ajeh chu keiman Baal anga kilhaina lentah kabol ding ahi. Koihileh ahunglou chu thi ding ahi,” ati. Ahinlah Jehu chun Baal doi houho jouse suhmangna dinga duha thuhtah agonjoh ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun Jehu'n, “Baal doi houna dingin mipi kikhopna thupitah gong’un!” tin thupeh aneijin ahi. Chuti chun amahon abol'ui.  
\v 21 Aman Israel te chenna gam pumpia Baal houho gakoukhom dingin mi asol'in ahi. Hijeh chun Baal doi hou ho jong akidalha khatcha jong um louvin ahung sohkeiyun ahi. Hiti chun Baal doi houna hou-in chu alodim sohhel jengun ahi.  
\v 22 Jehu in vonchol vesuipa jah a chun, “Baal doi houva hung jousen hiche vonchol hi khatjoh joh akivon diu ahi,” ati. Hijeh chun vonchol chu apetauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hijou chun Jehu chu Recab chapa Jehonadab chutoh Baal doi houna in a chun alut lhon tan ahi. Jehu in Baal doi hou ho kom’a chun, “Hiche munna hi Baal doi houho bou um ding ahi, ahinla Pakai houho vang naum sah louhel diu ahi,” ati.  
\v 24 Hiti chun amaho chu kithoina gantha ding leh hal namna bol dingin hou-in sunga chun adimset jeng tauvin ahi. Jehu'n amite somget ho chu phatah in ahilchah in inpolang’a chun aumsah tan ahi. Chuin Jehu in ajah uvah, “Ama ho hi khat nalhasou jongleh na hinkhou kila ding ahi,” atipeh tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Jehu in kilhaina gantha leh halnam chu achaiphat in ama noija lamkai ho leh sepaiho chu thu apepaijin, “Lut unlang abonchauvin thatgam tauvin khatcha jamdoh sah hih un,” ati. Hichun amaho jong alut un, achemjam’un athat gam tauvin ahi. Lamkai ho leh sepaiho chun atahsa uchu polang’a ahin kaidoh un ahi. Hiche jou chun Jehu mite chu hou-in sungnungpen achun alut un ahi.  
\v 26 Ama hon Baal doi ahounau adoikhomho jouse jong ahin pudoh un ahal lha tauvin ahi.  
\v 27 Ama hon ahin putdoh u Baal houna doikhomho jouse jong chu avochip un Baal hou-in jong avolhu uvin mipi ehbuh in amang’un tuni geijin akimang nalaijin ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Hiti hin Jehu in Israel te lah a kon'in Baal doi kihouna jouse chu ana subeijin ahi.  
\v 29 Ahinlah aman Bethel leh Daan a konna Nebat chapa Jeroboam in Israel mite chonsetna a ana puilut sana a kisem bongnou lim houna chu ana sumang tapon ahi. \x + \xo 10:29 \xt 1 Lgt 12:28-30\x*   
\p
\v 30 Ahijeng vangin Pakaijin Jehu kom’ah, “Ka thupeh nanit a Ahab insung na suhmang jeh in nabol phalheh jenge. Hijeh chun na chilhah ten khangli geija lengmun ahinlo diu ahi,” atipeh tai.  
\v 31 Ahinlah Jehu'n Pakai Israel Pathen danthu chu alungthim pumpin ana nitpon ahi. Jeroboam in Israel te ana chonset sahna a kon'in kilehei sah ding ana gopon ahi.   
\s1 Jehu Thi  
\p
\v 32 Hiche phat laitah chun Pakaijin Israel lenggam chu ana lhekeh pantan ahi. Hazael lengpan hiche gam chu mun phabep ana gal in ana kilah tan  
\v 33 agam lahho chu solam Jordan apat Gilead, Gad, Reuben leh Manasseh gam pumpi ahop’in ahi. Aman Aroer khopi a patnin Arnon phaicham akon’in sahlang gamkaija Gilead leh Bashan chan gei ana lan ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Hiche banna Jehu vaihom sunga thilsoh ho jouse, athibol ho leh atohdoh ho jouse chu \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it* a akijihlut sohkeijin ahi.   
\p
\v 35 Jehu athi phat in, Samaria khopiah avuijun ahi. Ama jou chun achapa Jeho-ahaz chu leng ahung chang tan ahi.  
\v 36 Jehu hin Samaria a kon'in Israel chunga chun kum somni le get vai anahom in ahi.   
\c 11  
\s1 Athaliah Lengnu In Judah Chung’a Vai Ahop  
\p
\v 1 Judah lengpa Ahaziah nu Athaliah chun, achapa thi ahetdoh phat in, aman leng insung mite jouse chu suhmanghel ding ana gotan ahi.  
\v 2 Ahinlah Ahaziah sopinu Jehosheba, Jehoram lengpa chanu chun Ahaziah chapa Joash chu chapang cha ana hinalaijin, leng insung mite jouse thagam ding thu ajahdoh phat in Joash chu ana guhdoh a ahin sintounu chutoh alupna insung dan sunga chun ana sellin, Athaliah khutthah a kon chun ana huhdoh in ahi.  
\v 3 Athaliah lengnu in kum gup sung jen leggam sunga vai ahop sungin Joash chu Pakai Hou-In sunga ana kisel’in ahi.   
\s1 Athaliah Douna  
\p
\v 4 Athaliah vaihom kal kum gup kichai akum sagi lhin kum in, Jehoiada thempu in asepai lamkaipa, Car mite sepai ho, chuleh khopi ngah a pangho Pakai Hou-In a akoukhom tan ahi. Hichun aman amaho chutoh Pakai Hou-In’ah khonung chan geiya dettah le kitah tah a adinpina diuvin akihahsel sah in chule kitepna khat ana sempeh in, hiche jou chun aman lengpa chapa Joash chu ahin puidoh in amaho chu avetsah tan ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Jehoiada chun amaho kom achun, “Nangho hop thum a naki khen uva, hopkhat cholngah nileh leng inpi ngah a napan diu ahi, hiche hi nabol tei diu ahi.  
\v 6 Hopthum a hopkhat dangma chu, Sur kelkot ngah a napan diu chuleh hopthum a hopkhat dangma chu khopi ngah a napan diu, akisei hicheng thum a hi naboncha uva khopi na nga diu ahi.  
\v 7 Cholngah nikhoa kin bollou loini chun, Pakai Hou-In a lengpa nadinpi diu ahi.  
\v 8 Nakhut uva gal manchah nakichoi uva lengpa tahsa hoibitna dinga akimvel'a nadin diu, chule koi hijongleh ahung lhailut goa aum leh natha jeng diu ahi. Lengpa chu achena channa najui diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Hiti chun sepai vaipo ho chun Jehoiada thempun aseipeh bang bangun abollun ahi. Sepai vaipo ho chun cholngah nia panla ding ho ahin alalou ding ho ahin asepai te cheh uchu Jehoiada thempu pa kom'ah ahin puijun,  
\v 10 chule aman amaho chu tengcha ho leh ompho ho chu ana ban hoppeh in ahi, hiche manchah ho hi David lengpan Pakai Hou-In a ana kikoi jing ahi.  
\v 11 Leng inpi ngah ho chun amanchah u kigosademin akichoi uvin alengpau chu aum kimvel un ana ngah un ahi. Ama ho chun Hou-In lhanglang ning apat sahlang ning geijin akigol lhungkei jun, maicham jong aumkimvel un ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Hichun Jehoiada in lengpa chapa Joash chu ahin puidoh in, aluchanga lallukhuh akhuh peh in Pathen danthu lekhabu khat apen, hiti chun thao anun, leng ahitai tin aphongdoh un, mijousen khut abengun, “Lengpa damsot hen!” tin asam un ahi.   
\s1 Athaliah Lengnu Thi  
\p
\v 13 Athaliah in mipi ho leh leng inpi ngah ho husan chu ajahdoh phat in, ipi thil aso vedingin gangchal’in Hou-In langa chun aga lhailut tan ahi.  
\v 14 Amun aga lhun phat in, lallukhuh kikhuh a lengthah khat chonna ngaidolla thunei tah a khompi kom’a ana din chu amutan, chule sepai lamkai ho leh pengkul mut ho avel'a adin chule gamsung pumpia mipi ho chun kipah tah a sumkon amut u aga mudoh tan ahi. Hichun Athaliah in hiche ho jouse hi amudoh phat in, alung ana behseh jengin aponsil abotttel in, “Lengmun chu! Lengmun chu!” tin asam tai. \x + \xo 11:14 \xt 2 Lengte 23:3\x*   
\p
\v 15 Jehoiada thempu pan asepaiho vesuija pang sepai lamkai ho chu thu apen, “Amanu chu man unlang Hou-In maija sepai ho lah akhun puilut un, chuleh koi hileh amanu huhna dinga hunglut aumleh that jengun,” atin ahi. Ajeh chu thempu pa chun, “Amanu chu Pakai Hou-In sunga tha louding ahi,” anati sa ahi.  
\v 16 Hichun ama hon, amanu chu aman un, leng inpia sakolte lutna kelkot langa chun apui mangun, hikom’a chun athat tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Jehoiada In Hou Asemphat  
\p
\v 17 Hichun Jehoiada in miho jouse chu Pakai mite ahina diuvin, Pakai leh lengpa kikah chuleh mipi kikah a kitepna khat asem tan ahi. Chujongleh aman lengpa leh mipi kikah a jong kitepna khat asemin ahi.  
\v 18 Hichun gamsunga mipi ho jouse chu acheuvin Baal doi houna hou-in ho chu asuseuvin, adoiphung u, maicham leh adoilimho jouse chu asuchip un chuleh Baal thempu Mattan jong chu adoiphung maicham maitah achun athat tauvin ahi.  
\p Hiche jou chun Jehoiada thempu pan jong, Pakai Hou-In vengtup dingin sepai ana koiyin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hijou chun sepai lamkai ho leh Car mite sepaiho chuleh leng inpi ngah sepaiho chuleh gamsung mipi ho chun Joash lengpa chu Pakai Hou-In'a kon'in ahin puidoh un, leng inpi ngah ho panmun kelkot achun ahung kitollut uvin, chuin lengpa chu lengte laltouna a chun atoutai.  
\v 20 Hiti chun gamsung mipi abonchauvin akipah sohkeiyun chule gamsung’a chamna ana lengpan tan ahi, ajeh chu leng inpia chu Athaliah kitinu ana tha u ahitai.   
\p
\v 21 Joash in lengvai ahinpoh chun ama kum sagi bou ahi nalaijin ahi.   
\c 12  
\s1 Joash In Hou-In Asah Phat  
\p
\v 1 Israel a leng Jehu vaihomna kum sagi lhin kum'in Judah a Joash in vai ahom panin ahi. Ama hin Jerusalem’ah kum somli lengvai anapo in ahi. Anu chu Zibiah ahin, Beersheba khomi ahi.  
\v 2 Joash in ahinkho lhumkeijin Pakai mitmu’n thilpha jeng ana bollin ahi, ajeh chu ama chu Jehoiada thempun ana khoukhah jing jeh ahi.  
\v 3 Ahijeng vang'in aman pathen dang kithoina doikhom ho ana sumangpon ahi, hiti chun mipi hon kithoina gantha ho leh halnam ho anabol jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Nikhat hi Joash lengpan thempuho kom’ah, “Pakai Hou-In'a hung kitohdoh sum jouse ahin, mihem in amichangval a ahin todoh sum jouse ahin, mihem ama-ama lungthim sung cheh a thanopna aneiya Pakai Hou-In sunga ahin todoh sum jouse ahin abonchan khol tup un. \x + \xo 12:4 \xt Potdohbu 30:11-16\x*  
\v 5 Hiche sumho lah a kon hin phabep hi thempu hon la uhenlang, angaichat dungjuiya Hou-In semphatna in mang uhen,” ati.   
\p
\v 6 Ahinlah Joash vaipohna kum somni le thum channa geijin jong thempu hon Hou-In semphatna natoh ima anapan polaiyun ahi.  
\v 7 Hijeh chun Joash lengpan Jehoiada leh thempu dang ho akoukhom in, “Ipi dinga Hou-In na semphat loulai uham? Sum ho hi nangho phatchomna dingin moh manchatvai tahih un, tu apat vang'in hiche sum ho hi Hou-In semphatna dinga aboncha naman diu ahi” ati.  
\v 8 Hiti chun thempu hon mipi ho a konna sum lah tahlou dingin akilol un, chuleh Hou-In semphatna dinga mopohna jong hi midang nganse dingin anom tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hichun Jehoiada thempu pan thih thingkong lentah khat asem’in, asin avitvangin hichu Pakai Hou-In hunglutna maicham jetlang sanga chun akoiyin ahi. Hichun thempu kotngah a pangho chun, mipi sumto ho chu alauvin thingkong sunga chun ahenglut jiuvin ahi.  
\v 10 Hiche thingkong chu adimphat leh, leng insunga kimangcha lekhajihpa leh thempulen pa chun Pakai Hou-In’a hung kitohdoh dangka ho chu asimtohji lhon'in, chujou teng chule khaodip khatna akhumji lhon'in ahi.  
\v 11 Chujou tengleh sum chu Pakai Hou-In semphatna a vaipo ho khutna apedohji lhon'in, ama hon Pakai Hou-In semphatna a natong ho apekit jiuvin ahi. Amaho chu, thingthem bol ho leh insaho,  
\v 12 thing vaibol ho leh songkheng ho, apeuvin ahi. Ama hon sum chu Pakai Hou-In semphatna dia thing le song kikheng chaisa ho chohnan jong amangun, chujongleh Hou-In kisah phatna dia manna ding jousen jong ana mangcha uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Hiche sum, Hou-In a hunglut ho chu, Hou-In sunga manchah ding kisilna dangka kong ahin, thaomeija manchah ding chaiche ahin, konglenho le khon ho ahin, sumkon chuleh sana le dangka a kisem thil adang-dang ho kisemnan khatcha akimang pon ahi.  
\v 14 Sum chu mopo ho apeuvin, Hou-In semphatna a bou akimangin ahi.  
\v 15 Hiche natohna a kimangcha ho vesuija pangho hi milungtheng leh tahsan theitah ngen ahijeh un, Jehu in sum kimanchahna ho chu dihnam tia kholtoh ding ngaikhoh asapon ahi. \x + \xo 12:15 \xt 2 Lengte 22:7\x*  
\v 16 Ahinlah suhkhelna ho leh chosetna ho thoidamna dinga hung kitohdoh ho vang Pakai Hou-In’ah ahunglut jipon, hiche ho chu thempuho apeh jiuva ama hon adeidan danna akimanchah jiu ahitai. \x + \xo 12:16 \xt Thempu Dan 7:7\x*   
\s1 Joash leng vaipoh kichai  
\p
\v 17 Hiche phat laitah hin, Aram lengpa Hazael chu Gath sat dingin akon'in ajouvin alenggam sung'ah akilahlut tan ahi. Hiche jou chun ahung kinunglen Jerusalem nokhum ding agotan ahi.  
\v 18 Hichun Joash lengpan ama masanga Judah lengho, Jehoshaphat in Pathen'a ana todoh ho, Jehoram, Ahaziah chuleh ama tah in ana todoh thengho jouse chu achom khomin, Pakai Hou-In leh leng inpia sumkholna mun'a sana ho jouse toh abonchan Hazael chu athot tan ahi. Hichun Hazael in Jerusalem anokhum got chu anokhum tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Joash vaihom sunga thilsoh ho jouse leh anatoh, athilbol ho jouse chu \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu\it* a aum sohkeijin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Joash chu anoija natong pipui hon ama dounan tohgon ana neijun, Silla jotna Beth-millo lamlen'ah ana that tauvin ahi.  
\v 21 Ama ana that ho chu Shimeath chapa Jozacar leh Shomer chapa Jehozabad ahi lhon'e. Amani hi ani lhona hi lengpa dinga tahsan umtah lengpa thumop’a pang anahi lhon'in ahi. Joash chu David khopi ah apu apate kivuina a ana kivui tan ahi.   
\c 13  
\s1 Jehoahaz In Israel Chung’a Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 1 Judah gam’ah Joash lengpa vaihom kum somni le thum lhin kum’in, Jehu chapa Jehoahaz in Israel gam’ah lengvai ahin hom panin ahi. Ama hin Samaria gamsung'ah kum som le sagi vai ana hom in ahi.  
\v 2 Ahinlah aman Pathen mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bolin ahi. Aman Nebat chapa Jeroboam in Israel te ana chonset sah bang bangin Jeroboam chondan jouse chu ana juitan ahi.  
\v 3 Hijeh chun Pakai chu Israel chunga ana lunghang lheh jengin, hijeh chun Aram lengpa Hazael leh achapa Ben-Hadad chu avel vellin ana josah in ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Hijou chun Jehoahaz chu Pakai kom’ah ana taovin panpina ana thum’in ahileh, Aram lengpan Israel te chu ana ha suhgenthei val jeh chun Pakaijin ataona ana sangin ahi.  
\v 5 Hijeh chun Pakaijin mikhat asol'in Israel te chu Aram te suhgentheina a kon'in aga huhdohsah tan ahi. Hijou chun Israel te chu tumasanga bangin lungmongin ana cheng tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Ahinlah Jeroboam umchan ala uvin ana chonse jom kitji uvin ahi. Ama hon Samaria a um Asherah doiphung jong chu ana kitunsah jing nalai uvin ahi.  
\v 7 Ajona in Jehoahaz sepaiho jong ahung alhom lheh tan, sakol kangtalai touthem 50, sakol kangtalai 10, chujongleh keng sepai 10,000 bou ahitan ahi. Adangse chu Aram sepai ten ana thagam’u ahitan akeng uva vutvai bang’a ana chotpha gam'u ahitai.   
\p
\v 8 Jehoahaz vaihom sunga thilsoh ho, ama natohdoh le thilbol ho chule athaneina ho chu \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a akijihlut tan ahi.  
\v 9 Jehoahaz athi phat in Samaria gamah avui tauvin ahi. Ama jouvin Jehoahaz in leng mun ahinlo tan ahi.   
\s1 Jehoash In Israel Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 10 Judah gam’ah Jehoash lengpa vaihom kum somthum le sagi lhinin, Israel gamah Jehoash in lengvai ahin hom pan tan ahi. Aman Samaria gamsung ah kum som le gup sungin lengvai ana hom in ahi.  
\v 11 Ahinlah ama hin Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin Nebat chapa Jeroboam in Israel te ana chonset sahna a konna chu kilehei ding ana nompon ahi.   
\p
\v 12 Jehoash vaihom sunga thilsoh ho jouse leh aman ana tohdoh ho leh athaneina chan geija anatoh ho chuleh Judah lengpa Amaziah toh gal ana kisattona ho abonchan \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a abonchan akijihlut sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 13 Jehoash athi phat in Israel lengho kivuina Samaria mun'ah chun ana vui tauvin ahi. Hiche jou chun achapa Jeroboam nina in lengvai ahin popan tan ahi.   
\s1 Elisha Gao Thusei Achaina  
\p
\v 14 Elisha chu athikon natna jalkhun a aum jinglai ahin, Israel lengpa Jehoash in agavil’in aga ka khum’in , “ Hepa! Hepa! Israel te kangtalai tou them ho leh akangtalai hou kamun ahi!” ati. \x + \xo 13:14 \xt 2 Lengte 2:12\x*   
\p
\v 15 Elisha’n ajah a, “Thalpi khat le thal chang phabep gakilah tan,” ati. Hijeh chun aman jong thalpi khat le thalchang phabep aga kilah in ahi.  
\v 16 Elisha’n ajah a, “Thalpi kisadoh tem’in,” atia ahileh amanjong akisadoh kittai. Hichun Elisha’n lengpa khut teni chunga chun ama khut tenin atuh in ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Hitin aseitai, “Nisolam a bangkot chu hongdoh tan,” atileh amanjong ahongdoh tai. Chujouvin Elisha’n, “Kap jeng tan,” atileh aman thal changkhat akaptai. Hichun Elisha’n jong, “Hiche chu Pakai thal chang ahi, Aram mite chunga galjona thalchang ahi, ajeh chu nangin Aram mite chu Aphek munna nasuh gamhel ding ahi,” tin aphongdoh tai.   
\p
\v 18 Chuin Elisha’n jong aseikti in, “Tun nangin thalchang dang ho chu kilah inlang tol chu jeptan,” ati. Hichun lengpan jong thalchang chun tol chu thumvei ajeptai.  
\v 19 Ahin Pathen mipa chu achung’ah alunghang lheh jengin, “Nangin tol chu nga vei ahilouleh gup vei najep ding ahi,” tin aman asamjah jeng tan ahi. “Chutileh nangin Aram mite chu na suhmang hel ding ahi. Tunvang nangin thumvei bou najo ding ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 20 Hichun Elisha athin ahileh ana vui tauvin ahi.  
\p Hichelai chun Moab sepai ten chavang lai seh leh Israel te chu gal in ahin nokhum jingkei uve.  
\v 21 Khatvei hi Israel te phabep in mithi khat hi anavui un ahileh hiche minokhum sepai ho chu amu uvin, amahon jong kinotah in mithipa tahsa chu Elisha kivuina lhan sung’a chun alehlut un ajamdoh tauvin ahi. Ahin mithi long chun Elisha guchu atohkhah phat in ahung hingdoh in, akengah ahung dingdoh kit tan ahi.   
\p
\v 22 Jehoahaz lengpa vaihomlai sungsen Aram lengpa Hazael in Israel te hi ana ha suhgenthei lheh jengin ahi.  
\v 23 Ahin Pakai chun Israel te alungset le akhotona jeh in, abon'in asuhmang sah dehpoi. Abraham, Isaac chule Jacob toh akitepna jal chun ana panpi jing nai. Hiti chun aman tuni chan geijin amaho hi abonin asumang pon chuleh ama angsunga kon'in jong apaimang chom dehpon ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Aram lengpa Hazael athitan ahileh achapa Ben-Hadad in ama khellin lengmun alotan ahi.  
\v 25 Jehoash pa Jehoahaz a konna ana lahpeh u khopi ho chu Jehoash in Hazael chapa Ben-Hadad a kon'in akile lahdoh kittan ahi. Jehoash in Ben-Hadad chu thumvei jen ana jouvin Israel khopi ho chu ana kile lahdoh gamtan ahi.   
\c 14  
\s1 Amaziah In Judah Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 1 Israel lengpa Jehoash vaihom akum ni lhinin, Judah gamsunga Joash chapa Amaziah in lengvai ahin hompan tan ahi.  
\v 2 Amaziah chu leng ahung chan chun ama kum somni le nga ana lhing tan ahi. Aman Jerusalem'ah kum somni le ko sungin lengvai ana hom'in ahi. Anu min chu Jehoaddin ahin, Jerusalem kho mi ahi.  
\v 3 Amaziah hin Pakai mitmu’n thilpha jeng abollin ahi, ahinlah apu David toh ana bang joupon ahi. Chuti tah sangin apa Joash chondan joh ana juijin ahi.  
\v 4 Amaziah chun doiphung ho chu ana suse dehpon, chule mipi ho chun doiphunga chun kilhaina gantha leh gimnamtui lhutna chu abol jingun ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Amaziah chun leng ahina akisuhdet phat chun, apa ana that ho jouse chu ana khailih tan ahi.  
\v 6 Ahijeng vang'in, aman apa ana that ho chate ho khatcha ana that pon ahi, ajeh chu aman Mose dan lekhabua Pakai thupeh chu ana juijin: “Achateu chonset jeh a anu apate tha louding ahilouleh anu apateu chonset jeh a achateu thalouding, thi dinga lomho chu ama chonset jeh a bou tha ding,” ti ahi. \x + \xo 14:6 \xt Danbu Ni Na 24:16\x*   
\p
\v 7 Amaziah in Chikhuh Phaicham’ah Edom mite 10,000 ana that in ahi. Aman Sela khopi jong ana jouvin, akhopi min jong Joktheel in ana khellin, tuni chan geijin hiti hin akisah dentai.   
\p
\v 8 Nikhat Amaziah lengpa in Jehu tupa Jehoahaz chapa Jehoash chu chounan thu athot in, “Hungin gal kisatto hite,” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Ahin Israel lengpa Jehoash in Judah lengpa Amaziah chu hiche thusim hi athot in, “Lebanon lhang'a lingphung khat in, Lebanon molla Cedar thingphung kom'ah thu athot in hitin ana seije, ‘Na chanu chu kachapa ji dingin neipen,’ tin athum’in ahi. Ahin Lebanon lhanga cheng gamsa khat in lingphung chu ahin jotpan, akengin achon lhutai!   
\p
\v 10 “Nangin Edom mite chu najo jeh a chu nalungthim’a nangma kichoisanga nahi. Ahin na minthanna a chun lunglhai inlang, inmun'a kitou thim’in, ajeh chu ipi ding penna nangin naboina ding le Judah gam mipite manthah lona dia mi phin lunghang’a nahim?” ati.   
\p
\v 11 Ahinlah Amaziah in athusei angaipeh tapon ahi, hijeh chun Israel lengpa Jehoash in asepai te akigontoh in, Judah lengpa Amaziah toh kisat dingin akontai. Galsat ding hungkon sepai teni chu Judah gam Beth-Shemesh mun'ah chun ana kisatto tauvin ahi.  
\v 12 Judah te chu Israel sepai ten ano cheh gam tauvin, asepai teu akithe cheh uvin a inlang cheh uvah ajam gam tauve.  
\v 13 Hichun Israel lengpa Jehoash in, Ahaziah tupa chuleh Joash chapa Judah lengpa Amaziah chu Beth-Shemesh a chun ana man tan ahi. Chujouvin Israel ten Jerusalem khopi chu anopaiyun, Jerusalem kulpi pal feet 600 a sang, Ephraim kelkot apat a Palningkoi Kelkot gei asuhchim pehtan ahi.  
\v 14 Hichun aman Pakai Hou-In’ah sana le dangka chuleh thil jouse chu aki chomdoh in, chuleh leng inpi’a kon'in nei le gou jouse jong achom’in chuleh gal hingin mi tamtah jong akaimangin, Samaria khopi lamah akile tan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Jehoash vaipoh sunga thilsoh jouse leh aman ana tohdoh ho leh athaneina akhonna geija anatoh ho chuleh Judah lengpa Amaziah toh gal ana kisattona ho abonchan \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a aum sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 16 Jehoash athi phat in Israel lengte kivuina Samaria a chun avuijun ahi. Ama thi jou chun achapa Jeroboam nina chun lengmun ahin lotan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Israel lengpa Jehoash athi jouvin Judah lengpa Amaziah chu kum som le nga ahinbe nalaijin ahi.  
\v 18 Amaziah vaihom sunga thilsoh ho jouse chu \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu\it* a aum sohkeijin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Jerusalem’ah Amaziah hinkho lahna dingin thil guh gonna anaum jeh in, ama Lachish lam’ah ana jam'in ahi. Ahinla adou hon athat ding mi anung-nung’a ana sol’un ahile, ama hon ajamna mun'ah chun agathat un ahi.  
\v 20 Ama hon atahsa chu sakol in Jerusalem ah ahin le pohlut un David khopia apu apate kivuina mun'ah chun avui tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Judah mipi ten Amaziah chapa kum som le gup bep lhing, Uzziah chu apa Amaziah khellin leng dingin atung tauvin ahi.  
\v 22 Apa thijou phat in Uzziah in Elath khopi chu athah sem’in Judah a din ale la lut kittan ahi.   
\s1 Jeroboam Nina’n Israel Chunga Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 23 Judah gam'a Amaziah leng chan kal kum som le nga lhinin, Jehoash chapa Jeroboam nina in Israel chunga lengvai ahin hom pantan ahi. Jeroboam in Samaria a kum somli le khat sungin vai ana hom’in ahi.  
\v 24 Ama hin Pathen deilou lam thilse jeng ana bollin ahi. Nebat chapa Jeroboam in Israel te ana chonset sahna a kon'in ana kihei mang nompon ahi.  
\v 25 Jeroboam nina in Israel gam Lebo-hamath apat lhanglam twimang dung geiyin alelahdoh gam kittan ahi. Hiche hi Gath-hepher a konna themgao Amittai chapa Jonah kom'a Pakai Israel Pathen'in ana phondohsa dungjuiya thilsoh ahi. \x + \xo 14:25 \xt Jonah 1:1\x*   
\p
\v 26 Ajeh chu Pakaijin Israel te thohgimna nasatah chu ana mun, ahinla Israel te lah a soh hihen chamlhat hijongleh ahuhdoh diu mi ana mupon ahi.  
\v 27 Ajeh chu Pakaijin Israel tehi amin’u kathaimang sohkei ding ahi ana tilou jeh'in aman Jeroboam nina chu amaho huhdoh dingin ana mangchan ahi.   
\p
\v 28 Jeroboam nina vaihom sunga thilsoh jouse leh anatoh ho chuleh athaneinaho agalsat ho chuleh Judah gam anahi’ah Damascus leh Hamath jong Israel a dingin ana lalut in ahi. Hiche ho jouse hi \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a aum sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 29 Jeroboam nina athi phat in Israel lengho kivuina Samaria ah ana vui tauvin ahi. Hichejou hin achapa Zechariah chu ama banin leng achangtai.   
\c 15  
\s1 Uzziah In Judah Chunga Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 1 Israel lengpa Jeroboam nina vaihom kum somni le sagi lhin chun, Amaziah chapa Uzziah chun Judah lenggam'ah vai ahin hom pantan ahi.  
\v 2 Ama leng ahung chan kum chun, ama kum som le gup alhing tan ahi, chuleh aman Jerusalem’ah kum somnga le ni sungin lengvai ana hom in ahi. Anu chu Jerusalem'a kon Jecoliah ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ama hin apa bangin Pathen mitmu’n alung lhaina jeng ana bollin ahi.  
\v 4 Ahinlah aman doiphung ho ana sumang dehpon chuleh mipi hon kithoina gantha ana bollun hal namtui jong ana lhut un ahi.  
\v 5 Pakaijin lengpa chu ana phah sah in athi nikho geijin aphah in ahi. Ama chu in chom’ah atum’in ana chengin ahi. Lengpa chapa Jotham chu leng inpi ngah in ana pangin ahi, hiti chun aman gamsung mite lah a vai ana hom in ahi.   
\p
\v 6 Uzziah vaihom sunga thilsoh ho leh aman ana tohdoh ho jouse chu \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu\it*a aum'in ahi.  
\v 7 Uzziah athi phat in ama chu David khopia apu apate kivuina mun'ah ana kivuijin ahi. Achapa Jotham chun ama banin lengmun analo tan ahi. \x + \xo 15:7 \xt Isa 6:1\x*   
\s1 Zechariah In Israel Chung’a Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 8 Judah lengpa Uzziah in Judah gam anapoh kum somthum le get lhinin Jeroboam nina chapa Zechariah in Israel te chunga vai ana hom’in ahi. Aman Samaria ah lhagup vai ana hom in ahi.  
\v 9 Zechariah in apu apate bang bangin Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin, Nebat chapa Jeroboam in Israel te ana chonset sah bangin ama jong hiche chonsetna ho a kon'in kilehei ding ana nompon ahi.  
\v 10 Hijou chun Jabesh chapa Shallum chun Zechariah dounan lungthimse ana gongin mipi lah a ana that in, ama leng ahung chang tan ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Zechariah vaihom sunga thilsoh ho jouse chu \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a chun abon'in aum’in ahi.  
\v 12 Pakaijin Jehu kom’a ana sei, “Na chilhah te khangli geija leng kachan sah ding ahi,” tichu guilhunna ahi. \x + \xo 15:12 \xt 2 Lengte 10:30\x*   
\s1 Shallum In Israel Te Chunga Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 13 Judah gam'a Uzziah in leng achan kal kum somthum le ko alhinin, Jabesh chapa Shallum hin Israel gamsung’a lengvai ana hom’in ahi.  
\v 14 Hijou chun Gadi chapa Menahem chu Tirzah a kon'in Samaria-ah agachen ama chu athat in, lengmun ahin lotan ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Shallum vaihom sunga thilsoh ho chuleh alungthimse gonho pum chun, \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a abonchan aum’in ahi.   
\s1 Menahem In Israel Chunga Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 16 Hiche pat chun Menahem in Tappuah khopi leh avel'a gamho jouse, Tirzah geijin asumang hel in ahi, ajeh chu akhomite le akimvel a mite, akhopi ho chu akom'a ahin pehlut nomlou jeh u ahi. Aman agamsung mite jouse chu athat gam’in chule numei gailai ho jong akhedoh sohkeijin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Judah gam’ah Uzziah lengpan lengvai ana hom kal kum somthum le ko alhinin, Gadi chapa Menahem in Israel gam’ah lengvai ana hom’in ahi. Aman Samaria a hin kum som sungin lengvai ana hom’in ahi.  
\v 18 Ahin Menahem hin Pathen mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bol'in ahi. Avaihom sung hin Nebat chapa Jeroboam in Israel te achonset sahna a konna kilehei ding ana nompon ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hijou chun Assyria mi Tiglath-pileser lengpan gamsung chu gal’in ahin nokhum tan ahi. Ahinla Menahem in athaneina a vai ahomjom jouna dingin ama chu dangka ton somthum le sagi anapen ahi.  
\v 20 Menahem hin Israel mite lah a ahaoho kom’ah sum namna in ala in, mikhat cheh chun Assyria lengpa hi dangka som nga cheh apeh diuvin thu apen ahi. Hiti chun Assyria lengpa chu Israel gam'a kon chun ahung kinungle tan ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Menahem vaihom sunga thilsoh ho chuleh aman atoh ho jouse chu \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a aum’in ahi.  
\v 22 Menahem athi phat in, achapa Pekahiah in leng mun ahinlo tan ahi.   
\s1 Pekahiah In Israel Chunga Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 23 Judah gam'a Uzziah in lengvai apoh kal kum som nga alhinin, Menahem chapa Pekahiah in Israel gam’ah lengvai ahin hompan in ahi.  
\v 24 Ahinlah Pekahiah chun Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin, Nebat chapa Jeroboam in Israel te ana chonset sahna a kon chun kiheimang ding ana nompon ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Hijou chun Remaliah chapa Pekah, Pekahiah sepai lamkaipa chun achunga thilse ana gongin ahi. Aman Gilead a kon'in mi som nga leh Argob le Arieh toh akitho in Pekahiah chu Samaria leng inpi ah chun ana that un, hiti chun Pekah leng ahung chang tan ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Pekahiah vaihom sunga thilsoh ho chuleh aman anatoh ho chu \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a abonchan aum’in ahi.   
\s1 Pekah In Israel Chunga Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 27 Judah gamsunga Uzziah lengpan aleng vaipoh kum somnga le ni alhinin, Remaliah chapa Pekah in Israel te chungah lengvai ana hom panin ahi.  
\v 28 Pekah in Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin, Nebat chapa Jeroboam in Israel te ana chonset sahna a konna kinung hei ding chu ana nompon ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Pekah vaihom sungin Assyria lengpa Tiglath-pileser in Israel ahin sat in Ijon khopi, Abel-beth-maacah, Janoah, Kedesh, leh Hazor khopi ho ana kilah tan ahi. Aman Gilead gam leh avel ho, Galilee chule Naphtali ho ajouvin chuleh mipi ho chu Assyria gam’ah gal-hing in ana kaimang tan ahi.  
\v 30 Hijou chun Elah chapa Hoshea chun Pekah douna lungthim phalou ana gongin, ana that dohtan ahi. Aman Uzziah chapa Jotham vaihom kal kum somni lhinin Israel chunga lengvai ana hom pantan ahi.   
\p
\v 31 Pekah vaihom sunga thilsoh ho, aman anatoh ho chu \it Israel Lengte Thusimbu\it*a aum’in ahi.   
\s1 Jotham In Judah Chunga Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 32 Pekah lengpan Israel gamsunga lengvai apoh kal kum ni lhinin, Uzziah chapa Jotham in Judah gam’ah lengvai ana hom’in ahi.  
\v 33 Aman lengvai ahinpoh chun ama kum somni le nga alhing tan ahi. Aman Jerusalem’ah kum som le gup sungin lengvai ana hom in ahi. Anu min chu Zadok chanu Jerusha ahi.   
\p
\v 34 Jotham hin Pakai mitmu’n thilpha jeng ana bollin, ama hin apa Uzziah bol bangin thil ijakai ana tongdoh sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 35 Ahinlah aman doiphung ho chu ana sumang pon chuleh mipi ho chun hikom'a chu kilhaina gantha le gimnamtui jong ana lhut un ahi. Aman Pakai Hou-In sahlam kelkot jong chu ana semphan ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Jotham vaihom sunga thilsoh jouse leh aman ana thilbol jouse \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu\it*a akijihlut sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 37 Hiche nikholai chun, Pakaijin Aram lengpa Rezin leh Israel lengpa Pekah chu Judah nokhum dingin ahin solpan tan ahi.  
\v 38 Jotham athi phat in David khopia apu apate kivuina mun'ah ana vuikhom tauvin ahi. Akhelin achapa Ahaz chun lengvai ahinpo tan ahi.   
\c 16  
\s1 Ahaz In Judah Chunga Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 1 Israel lengpa Pekah in lengvai ahop kal kum som le sagi lhinin, Jotham chapa Ahaz chun Judah gam’ah lengvai ahin hom pantan ahi.  
\v 2 Ahaz chu leng achan chun kum somni alhingtan ahi. Aman Jerusalem’ah kum som le gup sungin lengvai ana hom’in ahi. Aman apu David khonung ajuijin Pakai a Pathen mitmu’n thilpha jeng ana bolpon ahi.  
\v 3 Hiche sang chun, Israel lengho umchan ana juijin, achapa tah jeng jong kilhaina dingin ana tohdoh in ahi. Hiti chun aman Pathen'in Israel mite masanga ana deldoh peh u Pathen neilou nam mite thet umtah thil ana bolji hou chu ana juitan ahi. \x + \xo 16:3 \xt Danbu Ni Na 12:31\x*  
\v 4 Aman kilhaina gantha ana bollin, doi phung leh thinglhang chunglah thingdo-eng noi tinnah gimnamtui ana lhut in ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Hijou chun Aram lengpa Rezin leh Israel lengpa Pekah chu Jerusalem sat dingin ahungtou lhon tan ahi. Amanin Ahaz anokhum lhon'in ahinlah ana jou lhon pon ahi. \x + \xo 16:5 \xt Isa 7:1\x*  
\v 6 Hichelai phat tah chun Edom lengpan Elath khopi chu Edom mite dingin agalelah kittan ahi. Aman Judah te chu adeldoh in Edom mite chu-achun achen lutsah in, tuni geijin achengun ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Ahaz lengpan Assyria lengpa Tiglath-pileser chu thu athot in, “Keima hi nanoiya um nasoh kahin, hung touvin lang Israel lengpa le Aram lengpan eihung delkhum lhon akon hin neihung huhdoh in,” atin ahi.  
\v 8 Hijou chun Ahaz in Pakai Hou-In’a kon'in sana, dangka ho leh leng inpia sum le pai kholna a kon'in sana le dagka ho achomkhom in Assyria lengpa chu athot tan ahi.  
\v 9 Hiti chun Assyria lengpan Aram mite khopi Damascus chu anokhum’in amipite chu gal hingin akaijin Kir gamsungah achen sah tan ahi. Aman Rezin lengpa jong chu athat in ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Ahaz lengpa chu Assyria lengpa Tiglath-pileser toh kimuto dingin Damascus a achen ahi. Hilai munna aumpet chun, aman maicham phung kiboldan ho chu aven amelchih in, hijou chun aman alimdan ho chu hoitah in ajih doh in Uriah thempupa chu athot tan ahi.  
\v 11 Uriah chun lengpan ahilna ajuijin, maicham phung khat alim ahung kithot tobang bang chun ana semdoh in, lengpa Damascus a konna ahung kile tengleh avet dingin gonsan akoitan ahi.  
\v 12 Lengpa ahung kile phat in, hiche maicham phung chu aga kholchil in, hichun pumgo thilto abolpai tai.  
\v 13 Aman pumgo thilto atoh in, lhosoh thilto jong atoh in, lengpithei thilto jong achunga asunglhan chuleh maicham chunga chun chamna thilto thisan jong athe khum in ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Hijou chun Ahaz lengpan maicham thah le lutna lampi kikah a um Pakai Hou-In maija um sum-englui maicham chu aladoh in, maicham thahpa sah langa chun achon tan ahi. \x + \xo 16:14 \xt Potdohbu 27:1,2; 2 Thusimbu 4:1\x*  
\v 15 Aman Uriah thempupa kom’a chun, “Hiche maicham thahpa hi, jingkah a pumgo thilto kihalna ding leh, nilhah lang’a lhohsoh thilto ho tona ding, lengpa pumgo thilto tona ding, chuleh mipite jouse pumgo thil tona chuleh lhohso thilto leh atwija kisunglha tona ding ahi. Govam thilto ho leh pumgo thilto jouse a konna athisan chu maicham thah chunga hi nathe khum ding ahi. Sum-eng maicham vang hi keima chang maicham ding ahi,” ati.  
\v 16 Uriah thempu pan jong Ahaz lengpan aseipeh bang bangin abollin ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Ahaz lengpa chun Hou-In a kimang sum-eng kangtalai ho chengse chu aphelhan, hichea kon chun kisilna kong chu atoldoh paijin anoija kidinsah sum-eng bongchal ho chunga kon'in twikong chu adom lhan, chuin song inbul khat ah akoitai. \x + \xo 16:17 \xt 1 Lgt 7:23-39; 2 Thusimbu 4:2-6\x*  
\v 18 Assyria lengpa lunglhai sah tei ding gotnan, Ahaz lengpan Hou-In sunga kisa, cholngah nikhoa lengte thuseina phung aladoh in, chujongleh Hou-In sunga lengpa lutna kotpi geiyin atoldoh sohtai.   
\p
\v 19 Ahaz vaihom sunga thilsoh jouse leh aman anatoh ho aboncha \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu \it* a kijihlut sohkei ahi.  
\v 20 Ahaz athi phat in David khopia apu apate kivuina mun'ah avui tauvin ahi. Hijou chun achapa Hezekiah chun ama khel'in lengmun alotan ahi. \x + \xo 16:20 \xt Isa 14:28\x*   
\c 17  
\s1 Hoshea In Israel Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 1 Judah gam’ah Ahaz lengpan lengvai ahom kal kum som le ni alhin chun, Israel gam’ah Elah chapa Hoshea in lengvai ahin hom pantan ahi. Aman Samaria khopia kum ko vai ana hom’in ahi.  
\v 2 Aman Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin ahi. Ahinlah amasanga Israel te lengho bang lom-lom’in ana phamo sampon ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Assyria lengpa Shalmaneser in Hoshea lengpa chu gal ahinsat khum tan ahileh, Assyria te chun Hoshea chu nomna in kai gihtah ana pohsah un ahi.  
\v 4 Ahinlah Hoshea in kumseh a apeh u kai chu anapeh da'n, chule Egypt lengpa So kitipa toh kithoa Assyria te thaneina a konna hoidoh ding aguh in tohgon ana neijin ahi. Ahinlah hiche aguh a tohgon anei chu amudoh phat in Assyria lengpan Hoshea chu ana mandoh in songkul'a akoitan ahi.   
\s1 Assyria Ten Samaria Khopi Alah  
\p
\v 5 Hiche jou chun Assyria lenpan agam pumpi chu ahinsat tan ahile, Samaria chu kum thum sung jen hunom'in alahpeh tauvin ahi.  
\v 6 Ajonan Hoshea vaihom kum ko alhin chun Samaria alhutan, Israel mipite chu Assyria gam'a sohchang in analut tauvin ahi. Amaho chu Gozan munna Habor vadung pang juiya Halah gam chenna munho a chu ana chensah u ahi. Hichu Medes khopi ho khat ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Hitobanga Israel te chunga gim gentheina ahunglhun hi ama hon semthu pathen ana hou jeh u, chule Egypt lengpa Pharaoh thaneina a konna ahin huhdohpa chujongleh ahin puidoh uva Pakai a Pathe'u douna a chonset ana boljeh u ahi.  
\v 8 Ama hon Pakaijin amaho masanga ana nodoh peh u Pathen neilou nam mite chondan analah uva chuleh Israel lengte phabep in ahin pohlut u chonna ho anajui jeh u ahi.  
\v 9 Israel mipi loikhat in, Pakai a Pathen’u deilou lam le doumah thil tamtah aguh a anabol jeh u ahi. Ama hon Pathen neiloute, doiphungho, khovetna mun neo apatna khopi pal lenpen chung geija ama hon akisemdoh uva akitundoh u ahi.  
\v 10 Lhangvum dung jouse le thingna dum noi dung jousea doikhom ho leh Asherah doiphung ana kitun’un ahi. \x + \xo 17:10 \xt 1 Lgt 14:23\x*  
\v 11 Ama hon namdang te maicham phung dung’a gimnamtui alhut nam’un, agamsung a Pakaijin adeldohsa nam mite chonchan jouse ajom tauvin ahi. Hiti chun Israel ten setna tampi ana bollun, Pakai lung ahansah jiuvin ahi.  
\v 12 Pakaijin kichehtah a avel-vel'a aseipeh chule gihsalna avel-vel'a anapeh vangun semthu doi ana hou jing tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Pakaijin avellin themgao ho leh michingho anasol'in Israel te leh Judah te chu avel vellin hilchahna anapen ahi, “Na thilse bol nauva kon'in hung kileheijun, kathupeh ho leh ka dan semho, ka themgaote le ka lhachate mangcha a napu napa teu kana thupeh hohi jui unlang ngaiyun,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Ahinlah Israel ten ana nahsah pouvin ahi. Apu apa teuvin, Pakai a Pathen’u tahsan ding ana noplou bang bangun alungu ana tah un ahi.  
\v 15 Ama hon adanthu le apu apateu toh ana sem kitepna ho chu apaidoh un chuleh ana hilchahna ho jeng jong ana nasah pouvin ahi. Ama hon panna bei doiho pou ana hou un amaho tah jong manlou asohgam tauve. Ama hon avel uva cheng namdang te chondan alauvin Pakai thupeh jui louvin anot thap tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Ama hon Pakai a Pathen’u thupeh jouse apaidoh un, thih ahal jol’un bongnou ni lim asem tho uvin, Asherah doikhom’ah atungdoh un, Baal doi chuleh vanna ahsi te ho pou ana houvun ahi. \x + \xo 17:16 \xt 1 Lgt 12:28\x*  
\v 17 Ama hon chidang namdang te doi houna din achapa teu leh achanu teu pumgo thilto din kilhainan anei jiuvin ahi. Chule ama hon gaothem ho donga phun themho asansah jiu, Pakai mitmua thil dihlou bolna kipumpeh jeng ahiuvin, hijeh a chu Pakai chu aphin lunghang’u ahi. \x + \xo 17:17 \xt Danbu Ni Na 18:10\x*   
\p
\v 18 Pakai chu Israel te chung’a alunghan val jeh in, Aman amaho chu amitmua kon'in ana tolmang gamtan ahi. Judah changseh bou gamsunga ana chensah in ahi.  
\v 19 Ahivangin Judah te jengin jong Pakai thupeh ananit nom pouvin, Israel ten anaphudoh’u chondan phalou ngen chu anajom’un ahi.  
\v 20 Pakaijin Israel chilhah te chengse chu abonchan ana paidoh in ahi. Hiti chun ama mitmua konna apaidoh kahsen agal mite khut ah ana pehdoh in asugenthei in ahi.   
\p
\v 21 Pakaijin Israel te chu David lenggam'a konna alhekeh jouvin, ama hon alengpau dingin Nebat chapa Jeroboam chu ana kilhen tauvin ahi. Ahinlah Jeroboam in Israel te chu Pakai ajen ule ajui nauva kon'in ana puidoh in, chonsetna nasatah ana tohdoh sahtan ahi.  
\v 22 Hiti chun Israel ten Jeroboam nung ajuiyun, thilse lampia chun akimangcha un, achonset nauva kon'in ahung kiheidoh tapouvin ahi.  
\v 23 Themgao hon ana gihna bang bangun, Pakaijin Israel te chu amitmua konna apaidoh kahsen anga deh pouvin ahi. Hijeh chun Israel te hi agamsung uva konna paidoh a um uva tuni geija Assyria gam'a sohchang’a umden jing ahi tauve.   
\s1 Israel Gamsung’a Gamdang Mite Achen'u  
\p
\v 24 Assyria lengpan Babylon, Cuthah, Avva, Hamath le Sepharvaim khoho a kon'in mihem tampi ahin tollin amaho chu Samaria khopi dung’a chun Israel chate khellin achensah tai. Amaho hin Samaria gamsung alo uvin, akhopi dung jousea acheng tauve.  
\v 25 Ahinlah hiche gamchom mi ahung chenglut ho hin ahunglut til’un, Pakai ahou pouvin, hijeh chun Pakaijin alah uvah keipi bahkai ahin sollin mi phabep anathat un ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Hijeh chun Assyria lengpa kom’ah thu athot un, “Nangin Samaria khopi sungho a cheng dinga nahin sollut mipi ho chun hiche gamsung mite Pathen hou le chondan ho ahetlou jeh un, Pathen'in amaho sugam dingin keipi bahkai ahin sollut in ahi, ajeh chu ama hon Pakai ahoudan u adihlou jeh ahi,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 27 Assyria lengpa chun hiti hin thu apen, “Soh a kikaimang ho lah a thempu khat chu Samaria khopia lesolpeh un. Ama chu ahung chenglut thahho lah a chengin tin, agamsung mite Pathen houjedan le chondan ho gahil hen,” ati.  
\v 28 Hiti chun Samaria a konna hung sohchang thempu khat chu Bethel ah alesol un, aman achenglut thah ho chu Pakai houdan chu ahil pantan ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Ahinlah gamchom mi ahon honna hunglut ho chun ama-ama pathen cheh chu akihoujom jingun ahi. Achennau khopi khat a kon'in khopi khat ah Samaria mipi ten ana tundoh u doiphung hoa chun milim semthu ho chu akikoijun ahi.  
\v 30 Babylon’a konna hung hon, Succoth-benoth pathen chu ahouvun, Cuthah a konna hungho chun Nergal pathen chu ahouvun, chuleh Hamath a konna hunghon Ashima ahouvun ahi.  
\v 31 Avvit ten jong Nibhaz le Tartak pathen ahouvun, chuleh Sepharvaim a konna hung hon achateu chu apathen’u Adrammelech leh Anammelech hounan pumgo thilto in atohdoh jiuvin ahi.   
\p
\v 32 Hitobanga ahung chenglut thah ho hin Pakai jeng ven ahou jing nauve, alah uva kon'in thempu akilhengdoh un, chidang namdang te doiphunga doi hounan hiche thempu ho chu apansah jiuvin ahi.  
\v 33 Chule ama hon Pakai chu ahou jeng vang’un, ahung kondoh nau gamsunga kihou pathen ho jong adan dungjuiyun ama-ama indoi cheh jong akihou thouvun, chondan ho chu achepi jing nalaijun ahi.  
\v 34 Hiche achondan lui ho chu tunikho geijin achepiuvin ahi. Ama hon Pakai chu ahoutah tah pouvin, amavang tumasanga achonnau chu ajui-nalaijun ahi. Ama hon Pakaijin Israel tia amin ana khelpeh Jacob chihlhahte anapeh thupeh ho leh ajuidiuva dan ana sempeh ho chu khatcha jong ajui pouvin ahi. \x + \xo 17:34 \xt Semtilbu 32:28; 35:10\x*   
\p
\v 35 Ajeh chu Pakaijin Jacob chilhah ho chu kitepna ana semin, ajui diuvin thupeh hitin anapei, “Pathen dang hou hih un ahilouleh a ang’a jong nakun theilou diu, jen jong najen theilou diu, akom uva jong kilhaina nabol thei louhel diu ahi. \x + \xo 17:35 \xt Potdohbu 20:5; Danbu Ni Na 5:9\x*  
\v 36 Ahinlah, aban thahatna thaneitah a Egypt a konna nahin puidoh pa Pakai ama bou chu nahou diu, Ama angsung’a bou nakun diu chule kilhaina jong ama kom'a bou nasem diu ahi. \x + \xo 17:36 \xt Danbu Ni Na 6:13\x*  
\v 37 Nangho dia kipe danho le chonchan ding ho chule thupeh ho chu phattin le phatecha a nanit jing theina dingun phatseh in chingtheiyun lang semthu pathen kitiho nahou louhel dingu ahi.  
\v 38 Keiman nangho toh kasem kitepna chu sumil hihbeh un chujongleh pathen dang kiti pou-pou nahou thei louhel ding’u ahi.  
\v 39 Nanghon Pakai na Pathen bou nahou diu ajeh chu Ama chun na galmi houva konna nahin huhdoh diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 40 Ahinlah mipite chun hiche thu kisei ho chu ana nahsah pouvin, achonna u masa dungjui chun achon jom jingun ahi.  
\v 41 Hiti hin hiche ahung chenglut thah ho chun Pakai chu ahou vangun amaho milim doiho jong chu alhadeh pouvin ahi. Tuni chan gei hin achilhah teuvin jong achepi jingun ahi.   
\c 18  
\s1 Hezekiah In Judah Gamsung'a Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 1 Israel gam’a Hoshea leng chankal kum thum alhinin, Ahaz chapa Hezekiah in Judah gam’ah lengvai ahin hom pan’in ahi.  
\v 2 Ama leng ahung chan chun akum somni le nga alhing tan, chuleh Jerusalem’ah kum somni le ko lengvai anahom’in ahi. Anu chu Abijah ahin Zechariah chanu ahi.  
\v 3 Ama hin apu David bangin Pathen mitmun Pathen deilam jeng ana bollin ahi.  
\v 4 Aman Pathen neilouho doiphung ana sumangin doikhom jouse jong avobong sohkeijin, Asherah doikhom ho jong aphulhun, Mose’n sum-eng gullim ana semjong chu ana suchip in ahi, ajeh chu Israel ten hiche gullim kisem kom'a hi kilhaina asem uva gimnamtui jong ahal uva alhut nam jiu ahi. Hiche sum-eng gullim chu Nehushtan tin ana kihe in ahi. \x + \xo 18:4 \xt Minbu 21:9\x*   
\p
\v 5 Hezekiah in Pakai Israel Pathen chu ana tahsan’in ahi. Ama masang hihen anung hijongleh, Judah gam lengho lah a ama tobang koima ana umpon ahi.  
\v 6 Aman Pakai chu imalam jousea kitah tah in ana juijin, chuleh aman Pathen’in Mose anapeh thupeh ho chu lhingtah in ana juijin ahi.  
\v 7 Hijeh chun Pakaijin ama chu ana umpi jingin, chuleh Hezekiah hi abolna atohna chan’ah alolhing in ahi. Ama hin Assyria lengpa dounan kai pehding jong ana nompon ahi.  
\v 8 Aman Philistine te chu Gaza chan le agamsung’u khoneopen apat khopi lenpen Gaza le akimvel kho kulpi kikaikhum khopi geijin ana jouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Israel gam'a Hoshea Lengpa vaihomkal kum sagi alhinin, Hezekiah lengvai hom kum alhin in, Assyria lengpa Shalmaneser chun Samaria khopi ahin um’in ahi.  
\v 10 Kum thum nungin, Israel lengpa Hoshea leng chan kal kum ko alhin chuleh Hezekiah leng chan kal kum gup alhinin, Samaria khopi chu pangjou talouvin alhutan ahi.  
\v 11 Hiche phat chun Assyria lengpan Israel te chu Assyria gam Halah mun’ah sohchang’in akoitan ahi. Hiche hi Medes khopi sung Gozan munna Habon vadung pang ahi.  
\v 12 Ajeh chu ama hon Pakai a Pathen’u thupeh ajuinom pouvin, chuti sangin Pakai toh akitepnao asukeh un, Pakai lhacha Mose in danho le anit diuva athupeh ho ana nitnom pouvin ahi.   
\s1 Assyria In Judah Ahin Nokhum  
\p
\v 13 Hezekiah lengpa leng chan kal kum som le li alhinin, Assyria lengpa Sennacherib ahung kon’in Judah khopi kulpi kigensa khopi ho jouse chu ahin nokhumin, abonin alatan ahi.  
\v 14 Hezekiah lengpan Lachish munna um Assyria lengpa kom’a hiti hin thu athot in, “Keiman kabol kheltai, galbol nangah a nakinungle kit pou-pou leh, ijat hijongleh nangin nangeh chan kai pejeng tange,” ati. Assyria lengpan akinopto thei lhonna dingin dangka ton som le khat chuleh sana ton khat angeh in ahi.  
\v 15 Hijat suh bulhitna dingin, Hezekiah lengpan Pakai Hou-In’a dangka kikoi jouse leh leng inpia sum le pai jouse jong achomkhom’in ahi.  
\v 16 Hezekiah lengpan Pakai Hou-In kot tomna a ananei sana ho chu akhoh lhan chuleh kot khom ho chunga kiloi sana ho jong chu akhoh lhan Assyria lengpa chu apetan ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Ahijeng vang'in Assyria lengpan asepai lamkai lenpenpa toh, galmun a lamkaipa ahin asepai lamkaiho pipui chunga apipuipa chutoh Lachish a kon'in, sepai tamtah toh Jerusalem’a Hezekiah lengpa toh kimaito dingin asol'in ahi. Assyria mite hin sahlang twikul'a twi kilhana hohlam pang, louva kilhunglut a pon kisopna lamlen kom’a chun apangun ahi.  
\v 18 Ama hon Hezekiah lengpa chu kimupi dingin akouvun ahileh amaho toh kimuto ding anoija natong ho Hilkiah chapa Eliakim, leng inpia vaihompa, thutanna munna lekhasun Shebna chuleh lengte thusim chingpa Asaph chapa Joah hocheng chu ana sollin ahi.   
\s1 Sennacherib In Jerusalem Gihna Anei  
\m
\v 19 Hiche jou chun, Assyria lengpa noija lamkai pipuipa chun Hezekiah thuthot ana neiyin,  
\b  
\pmo “Hiche hi Assyria leng lenpa ama tah kamcheng ahi: Koipen na tahsan a, koipen na kisonpia hitia hi lung olmo louhel a naum ham?  
\v 20 Nangin thuhom keova hi sepai galsat thepna le athahatna ho akhel thei dia nagel ham? Koipen chunga na kingaiya keima nei dou jeng ham?  
\v 21 Ole Egypt nakisonpi ham? Egypt chunga nakingai ahileh hiche Egypt khu peng tenggol natahsa gih in atouchip a nakhut asut tobangbep hi ding ahi. Egypt lengpa Pharaoh hi kingaina thei hilouhel ahi.   
\pm
\v 22 Ahin nangin kakom’a, Keiho Pakai ka Pathen uva kingai kahi nati diu ahi, ahinla Ama chu Hezekiah in noise tah a anabol hilouham? Judah gam le Jerusalem mite Jerusalem maicham phungseh a bou Pathen hou dia seipeh a, Pakai doiphung jouse le maicham ho sumang pa Hezekiah hilou ham?   
\pmo
\v 23 Keiman naseipeh uvinge! Ka pakaipa Assyria lengpa hitoh kinoptona bol lhon’in, nangin mi nanei jou ding leh sakol 2,000 na penge.  
\v 24 Hitobang sepai hon lhomchakhat a hi, kapupa sepai hon ahatmopen jeng jong hi nachou ngam ding hinam? Egypt sakol kangtalai ho leh kangtalai touthem hotoh kitho jongle chun i-nalo ding ham?  
\v 25 Tua hi ipi mong-mong nagel ham, nagam kahin nokhum’u jong hi, Pakaijin eihinsol u ahi nahet lou uham? Gamsung khu ganokhum’un lang gasumang’un tia, Pakai ama tah chun eiseipeh lou uva nagel uham?” ati.   
\b  
\p
\v 26 Hichun Hilkiah chapa Eliakim, Shebna le Joah chun Assyria mite gal lamkai pipuipa kom’achun, “Lungset tah in keiho kom’ah Aramaic paovin nei seipeh un, hichu keihon jong phaten apao chu kahe nauve. Hebrew paovin nei seipeh hih un, ajeh chu pal chung’a mipi ho hin jakha get unte,” atiuve.   
\p
\v 27 Ahinlah sepai lamkai pipui Sennacherib chun ahin donbut in, “Ka pakai pauvin hiche thu hi napupau leh nangho chengseh jah dinga eiseisah uva nagel uham? Mijousen ajah ding hi aman adei ahi. Ajeh chu hiche khopi hi kalah tengu leh amaho jong nangho toh thohgim tha diu ahi. Genthei jeh a agilkel behseh tengleh a-eh aneh diu chuleh dangchah behseh tengleh ajun’u adon diu ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 28 Hichun sepai lamkai pipuipa chun pal chunga um mipi ho het dingin Hebrew paovin asap in asap thon, Assyria leng lenpa thupeh hi ngaijun!  
\v 29 “Lengpan asei chu hiche ahi: Hezekiah chu kilheplhah sah hih un. Aman itinama jongleh keima thaneina a kon'in na huhdoh jou pouvinte.  
\v 30 Aman nangho Pakai tahsan dingin kilhep lhahsah hih un, 'Pakaijin eihuhdoh tei diu ahi, hiche teho hi Assyria lengpa khutna lutlouhel ding ahi atiu chu tahsan hih un!' ati.   
\p
\v 31 “Hezekiah thusei tahsan hih un! Assyria lengpan nangho napehnom’u kitepna chu hiche hi ahi: Keitoh chamna sem’un, khopi kelkot hi hong’un lang hung potdoh un. Achutileh nang hon na lengpithei ule nathei chang’u nakineh diu, chuleh na twikul uva nakidon diu ahi.  
\v 32 Chutengleh keiman nangho hiche tobang gamchom khatna kapohlut diu, chang phatna le lengpithei phatna changlhah leh lengpithei phatna, olive thing le khoiju lonna mun a kapuilut ding nahiuve. Thina sang’in hinkho kilhen joh un!  
\p “Hezekiah in 'Pakaijin eihuhdoh diu ahi' atia nalhep lhah got’u chu ngai hih un!  
\v 33 Koipen nam apathen’un Assyria lengpa khut a ahuhdoh nahet khah uvem?  
\v 34 Hamath khopi le Arpad khopi tenia pathen'in ipi abolthei beh am? Chuleh Sepharvaim, Hena, leh Ivvah khopi ho a pathen'in ipi atohdoh beh am? Koi pathen'in ka thahatna a konna Samaria ahuhdoh beh am?  
\v 35 Itobang nam mite pathen'in ka thaneina a konna amite ahuhdoh beh am? Achutile ipi pentah chun Pakaijin Jerusalem hi ka khut a konna ahhuhing jou dia nagelsah mong’u ahidem?” ati.   
\p
\v 36 Ahinlah mipite chu Hezekiah in, “Thipbeh un donbut hih un,” tia thu apeh dungjuijun athipbeh un, koimacha apaopoh aum pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 37 Hijou chun leng inpia vaihompa Hilkiah chapa Eliakim, thutanna a lekhasun Shebna, chuleh thusimbu chingpa Asaph chapa Joah chu Hezekiah kom’ah acheuvin lunggim tah in asangkhol abot-eh un, hiti chun lengpa kimupin acheuvin, Assyria sepai lamkai pipuipa thusei chu aseipeh tauvin ahi.   
\c 19  
\s1 Hezekiah In Pakai Panpina Ahol  
\p
\v 1 Hezekiah lengpan hiche thulhutna chu ajahdoh phat in, apon abot-eh in, khaodip pon akisil'in Pakai Hou-In na aluttan ahi.  
\v 2 Hichun aman leng inpi vaipo Eliakim, thutanna lekhasun Shebna, thempu lamkai hon abon'un khaodip akisil'un Amoz chapa themgao Isaiah kom’ah asol'in ahi.  
\v 3 Hiche hi Hezekiah lengpan asei ahi, “Tuni hi lungkham nikho, kisuhjumna le eikinoise na nikho ahi. Hiche hi naosen sohlhago a, ahinla anun nao aso-lhahsahna dinga tha anei joulou tobang ahi.  
\v 4 Ahinlah Assyria lengpan a sepai lamkai pipuipa ahinsol’a hingjing Pathen chouna a athusei jouse chu Pakai na Pathen'in hiche engkalna a kiseiho hi ngaihen chuleh ahing nalai keiho chengse dingin Pathen henga hung tao teijin!” ati.   
\p
\v 5 Hezekiah noija natong lamkaihon lengpa thuthot Isaiah kom alhut nungun,  
\v 6 themgaopa chun hitin adonbut in ahi, “Na pakai pau kom’a chun hitin seipeh un, 'Pakaijin hitin aseije: Assyria lengpan kei douna thuchavai tah aseiho jeh hin lungkham hih hen.  
\v 7 Ngaijin! Keima tah in ama douna a pan kalah ding ahi, chutengleh hiche lengpa hin thulamleng khat ajah ding ainlam’a kile ding chuteng keiman katha ding ahitai,'” ati.   
\p
\v 8 Hiche kahlah chun, Assyria sepai gal lamkai pipu chun Jerusalem a kon'in Assyria lengpa kom’a kihoutoh dingin agachen ahile, lengpa chu Lachish dalhan Libnah khopi sat dinga ana kondoh in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Hiche joutah chun Ethopia lengpa Tirhakah in asepai te ahin lamkaijin ama sat dingin ahung kon’e tithu ajah phat in, ama chutoh kisatto dinga ache masangin Jerusalem a um Hezekiah chu hiti hin thu athot e:   
\b  
\pmo
\v 10 “Hiche thu hi Judah lengpa Hezekiah a ding ahi. Na tahsantah na Pathen chun Assyria lengpan Jerusalem hi alah joulou ding ahi atin, na Pathen chu kilhep lhah sah hih in.  
\v 11 Assyria lenghon agot gam leiset ipi aloji uvem, nangin hoitah in nahe in ahi. Koi hileh adou pen-pen ho chu asuhchip jeng’u ahi. Achutile nang chu ichom nahi deh em?  
\v 12 Namdang ho Gozan khopi, Haran khopi, Rezeph khopi le Tel-assar munna um Eden khopi mite ho chu, a pathen ho uvin ahuhdoh jou uvem? Kei masanga lenghon ana suhgam’u hilou ham?  
\v 13 Arpad khopi leng Hamath khopi chunga ipi soh em? Ivvah, Hena, Sepharvaim lengho itigam hiu hitam?” tin aseijin ahi.   
\b  
\p
\v 14 Solle ho a konna hiche thuthot hi Hezekiah in amu phat in alan asimtai, Pakai Hou-In'a ache touvin Pakai angah akiphajallin ahi.  
\v 15 Pakai ang’a Hezekiah hitin ataovin: “Vo Vantil lhaving nei Cherub te kikah a laltounna a tou, Pakai, Israel Pathen, vannoi leiset a lenggam jouse chung’a Pathen nangbou nahi. Nang bouvin van leh leiset nasem ahi. \x + \xo 19:15 \xt Potdohbu 25:22\x*  
\v 16 Vo Pakai, kachung uva thilsoh ho hi vengaijin!, chule Sennacherib in hingjing Pathen douna athuseiho pihi ngaitem’in.   
\p
\v 17 Pakai, Assyria lenghon namtin vaipi asuhgam’a, agamsung jouseu asuhbei gam’u ahi.  
\v 18 Chule ama hon hiche namdang hon ahou u apathen hou jengjong meiya alelut uva ahal gamu ahitai. Ahi chu Assyria ten a pathen hou chu asuhset uva agovam thei mong’u ahinai, ajeh chu amaho chu mihem khut a kisem, song le thing’a kisemthu doi ho chu ahibouvui.  
\v 19 Tuhin, O Pakai, ka Pathen'u, Assyria mite thaneina a kon'in nei huhdoh un, chutileh vannoi leiset a lenggam ho jousen nangma bou hi O Pakai, ka Pathen'u nahi ahet diu ahi,” ati.   
\s1 Judah Huhdoh A Aum Ding Isaiah Gaothusei  
\p
\v 20 Hiche jou chun Amoz chapa Isaiah in Hezekiah chu thu athot in: “Hiche hi Pakai Israel Pathen chun asei ahi. Assyria lengpa Sennacherib chung chang’a nataona kajah peh tai.  
\v 21 Chule Pakaijin ama dounan hiti hin thu aseije:  
\b  
\q1 “Nungah theng Zion chanu chun  
\q2 nangma navetda in nahin nuisat in ahi.  
\q1 Jerusalem chanu chun  
\q2 nangma pum chun isahlou tah in alu nahin hih khum’e.   
\b  
\q1
\v 22 Koiham nangin noise tah’a naphin phin chu?  
\q2 Koi douna thu nasap ham?  
\q1 Koiham nangin changmel’a navet chu?  
\q2 Hiche Israel Mitheng te ahiuve!   
\q1
\v 23 Na thupole’a pangho a kon'in nangman Pakai chu nachouve.  
\q2 Nangin naseijin, 'Ka sakol kangtalaiho mangchan  
\q1 molsangtah tah ho kalo uve natin,  
\q2 heng'e, gamla tah’a um Lebanon chu.  
\q1 Keiman ka tanbong tai Cedar thing ho  
\q2 leh Cyprus thing hoipen ho.  
\q1 Keiman agamlapen aningkoi ho jong kaphajou vin  
\q2 chule gammang gilpen jong kakholdoh’in ahi.   
\q1
\v 24 Keiman gamdang ho gamsunga jong twikul kalaidoh’in  
\q2 chuleh atwi jong kadonin kakisulip e.  
\q1 Kakeng tenin jong  
\q2 Egypt vadung jouse ka khamtan uve!'   
\b  
\q1
\v 25 Ahinlah nangin najah khahlou lai ham?  
\q2 Hiche hi sotna ahitai.  
\q1 Sotna kanagon pat ahitan,  
\q2 tua hi kahinso dohsah ding ahi.  
\q1 Keiman kul kigenkhum khopi ho nasuhchipna ding  
\q2 nasuhgoihelna dinga kanagon ahi.   
\q1
\v 26 Hijeh a chu amite ho uvin tha anei joulou’u  
\q2 chuleh amaho hi kichauva lungboija ahi tauve.  
\q1 Amaho hi hampa banga thaneijoulou ahiuvin,  
\q2 hampa hung poudohtil lhonal jing thei tobang ahiuve.  
\q1 Amaho hi inchunga hampa hungpoudoh til tobang ahin,  
\q2 akhan sang masanga nisan akahlihji tobang ahiuve.   
\b  
\q1
\v 27 “Ahinlah ken nangma kahei—  
\q2 hoiya konna nahung,  
\q1 hoilanga nache chuleh hoiya naum kahesohkeiye.  
\q2 Ichan geiya keima douna-a nachon jong kahei.   
\q1
\v 28 Chule hitia hi keima douna a na chelhah jing  
\q2 chujongleh neidou jing naho keima tah in kajah ahin,  
\q1 Keiman nanahkuiya nahkhao kabupeh’a,  
\q2 na nephu tenia kamdal kakoipeh ding nahi.  
\q1 chutengleh nahung konna  
\q2 nalampi mama a chu nakinung lekit ding ahi,” ati.   
\b  
\q1
\v 29 Hichun Isaiah in Hezekiah kom’ah, “Kathusei hi adih’e ti nahetna ding phatah chu hiche hi hi ding ahi:  
\b  
\q1 Tukum sunga hi achamcham'a hung kehdoh muchi gabou naneh diu,  
\q2 akumkit leh hichea kon ma-ma a hung gadoh chu naneh kit dingu ahi.  
\q1 Ahin kum thum phat vang leh muchi natua konna chu naki-at ding;  
\q2 chuleh lengpilei jong nabol’a aga naneh ding ahitai.   
\q1
\v 30 Chuleh Judah gamsunga kidalha chengse,  
\q2 athimoh ahingdoh chasun chun ajung’u akhothuh chehdiu,  
\q1 chule hung khangtou cheh uva  
\q2 hung kisepdoh ding ahiuve.   
\q1
\v 31 Ajeh chu Jerusalem a konna kamite amoh changse,  
\q2 Zion molla konna ahingdoh chengse chutoh hung kithejal ding ahi.  
\q1 Hatchungnung Pakaijin amikhotona a pan alahna chu  
\q2 ahin tahdoh ding ahi,” ati.   
\b  
\q1
\v 32 “Assyria lengpa chung changa Pakai thusei chu hiche hi ahi:  
\b  
\q1 “Asepai teu chu Jerusalem’a lutlou diu ahi.  
\q2 Ama hon thal changkhat jong ahin kaplut joulou diu ahi.  
\q1 Ama hon a-ompho’u puma kelkot pam’a hi kijot loudiu  
\q2 chujongleh khopi umna dinga leipel aset lou dingu ahi.   
\q1
\v 33 Lengpa chu gamsunga ahungna lampi mama a  
\q2 hunglut louding ahi, tin Pakaijin aseje.   
\q1
\v 34 Kamin loupina ding leh kasohpa David khohsahna jal’a,  
\q2 Keiman hiche khopi hi kavenbit a ka huhdoh ding ahi,” ati.   
\b  
\p
\v 35 Hiche jan chun Pakai vantil khat Assyria te ngahmun'ah achen Assyria te sepai 185,000 ho chu aga that tan ahi. Ahing doh Assyria te chu jingkah a athodoh uleh mithilong chu muntin’ah amu tauvin ahi.  
\v 36 Assyria lengpa Sennacherib chun ngahmun ahin dalhan, ama gamsunga ahung kile tan ahi. Ama Nineveh khopia a inlam ajonin hichea chun aum tan ahi.   
\p
\v 37 Nikhat hi semthu pathen Nisroch chu ahou-in’a aga hou pettah in, acha teni Adrammelech leh Sharezer chun chemjam’in athat lhon tan ahi. Amani chu Ararat gamlang’ah ajam lhon'in acha dangkhat Esarhaddon kitipa chun Assyria lengmun ahinlo tan ahi.   
\c 20  
\s1 Hezekiah Adammo Le Ahung Damdoh  
\p
\v 1 Hiche phat laitah in Hezekiah chu aha nat lheh jingin ahileh, Amoz chapa Isaiah themgao chu aven achen ahi. Aman lengpa chu hiche thu hi aseipeh tan ahi: “Hiche hi Pakai thusei ahi: Na insung kisemtoh tan, ajeh chu nang nathi ding ahitai. Hiche na natna a konna hi nakiledoh joulou ding ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 2 Hezekiah in hiche thu ajahdoh phat in, akiheijin banglang anga’n Pakai kom’ah atao tan,  
\v 3 “O Pakai, na ang’a kitah tah le gunchu tah a nakin kabol jing geldoh in, chuleh ichan geiya na lunglhaina a kana um jing ti neihin geldoh peh in,” atin, hijou chun lhasetah in hakan akap in ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Hichun Isaiah in lengpa adalhan, ahinla leng inpi thutanna lailung aphah masangin 'Pakaiya kon'in hiche thu hi ahunglhung in:  
\v 5 “Kamite lamkaipu, Hezekiah kom’ah gache inlang hiti hin gaseijin, Napu David Pakai Pathen chun hitin aseije: Keiman nataona kajan kasanpeh tai chuleh namitlhi jong kamun, keiman nangma hi kadamsah ding nahitai, tu apat nithum nileh nalupna a konna nathodoh ding Pakai Hou-In'a nache ding ahitai.  
\v 6 Keiman nahinkho hi kum som le kum nga kapehbe ding nahi, chuleh hiche khopi hi Assyria lengpa a konna ka huhdoh ding ahi. Keiman hiche khopi hi kamin loupina ding leh kasohpa David khohsahna jal'a kavenbit ding ahi,'” ati.   
\p
\v 7 Hichu Isaiah in, “Theichanga kon'in lounang sem’un,” ati. Hiti chun Hezekiah lhacha ten jong hiche lou chu anatna apomlai ho chun anu uvin ahileh Hezekiah ahung damdoh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Hichun Hezekiah in Isaiah kom’ah, “Tunia patna nithum nileh kadamdoh a Pakai Hou-In kaija kache thei ding chu Pakaijin ipi melchihna eipeh thei ding ham?” ati.   
\p
\v 9 Isaiah in jong adonbut in, “Pakaijin na teppehna bang-banga na damdoh sah ding melchihna chu hiche hi ding ahi. Hiche kalbi leiya nilim khu kalsom amachon ding, nadeijem ahiloule anung chon ding nadei jem?” ati.   
\p
\v 10 Hezekiah in jong, “Nilim khu kalsom amchon ding chu abainan hijeh chun kal som nungchon sah tan,” ati.  
\v 11 Hijeh chun Isaiah themgao chun Pakai kom’a ataovin ahile, Aman Ahaz kalbi leidoa nilim chu kalsom anungchon sah tan ahi!   
\s1 Babylon a Hungkon Solle Ho  
\p
\v 12 Hiche jou chun, Babylon lengpa Baladan chapa Merodach –baladan chun Hezekiah lengpa kipathu leh thilpeh ahin thot in ahi, ajeh chu aman Hezekiah chu aha nat lheh e ti ana jahdoh ahi.  
\v 13 Hezekiah in Babylon’a konna hung palai ho chu anei agoukholna insunga thil jouse chu sana, dangka, gimnamtui ahin thaonamtui ahin avetsah sohkeijin ahi. Aman amaho chu apuijin leng inpi sunga thil kholna a kikhol jouse chu gal manchah ho pum’in avetsah sohkeijin ahi. Aleng inpi sunga ahin alenggam sunga ahin Hezekiah in avetsahlou aum tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 14 Hichun Isaiah themgao chu Hezekiah lengpa kom’ah achen hitin aga dongtan ahi, “Hiche ho chun ipi adei uham? Amaho hoiya hungkon hiuvem?” ati.  
\p Hezekiah in adonbut in, “Amaho chu Babylon khopi gamla tah a hung kon ahiuve,” tin adonbut in ahi.   
\p
\v 15 “Ama hon na leng inpia hi ipi pi amu uvem?” tin Isaiah in adong'e.  
\p Hezekiah in adonbut in, “Keiman amaho chu kanei jouse kavetsah in, kaleng inpia kanei kagou jouse jong kavetsah sohkeijin ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Hichun Isaiah in Hezekiah kom’a chun, “Pakaiya kon'in hiche thupeh hi ngaijin:  
\v 17 Na leng inpia thil jouse, napu napate hon ana khol'u leh tuchan geija um nanei nagou jouse hi Babylon khopi a akipohlut diu nikho chu hunglhung ding ahi. Thilkep ho chu khat a khatcha kidalha louding ahi. \x + \xo 20:17 \xt 2 Lengte 24:13; 2 Thusimbu 36:10\x*  
\v 18 Nangma tah chapate phabep jong kikai mang ding amaho chu Babylon leng inpi sunga nukiso ahisah uva soh a pang diu ahi,” atipeh tan ahi. \x + \xo 20:18 \xt 2 Lengte 24:14,15; Daniel 1:1-7\x*   
\p
\v 19 Hezekiah in Isaiah kom’ah, “Hiche thupeh Pakaiya konna eikipe hi apha lheh jenge,” ati. Ajeh chu lengpan ageldan’a chu, “Keima hinkho sung beh in chamna le lungmon umnante,” atin ahi.   
\p
\v 20 Hezekiah vaihomlai sunga thilsoh jouse chuleh athaneina sunga ahin, chuleh aman twikul alaija, twilam anasem’a khopi sunga ana lonlutsah ho jouse chu \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu \it* a aum sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 21 Hezekiah athin, hichun achapa Manasseh in lengmun ahinlo tan ahi.   
\c 21  
\s1 Manasseh In Judah Gam'a Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 1 Manasseh chu leng ahung chan chun ama kumsom le kumni alhingbep in ahi. Ama hin kum somnga le nga sungin vai ahom’in ahi. Anu min chu Hephzibah ahi.  
\v 2 Ama hin Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin ahi. Ama hin Pathen'in Israel te masanga ana nodoh pathen neilou nam mite thet umtah chonna ho chu ana juijin ahi. \x + \xo 21:2 \xt Jeremiah 15:4\x*  
\v 3 Apa Hezekiah in ana suhmang pathen neilouho doiphung chu atungdoh kit in ahi. Aman Baal maicham jong asemdoh kit in, chule Asherah doikhom jong atungdoh kit in Israel lengpa Ahab bol tobang bangin abollin ahi. Vanthamjol'a thaneiho jouse anga ana bohkhup in chuleh hiche ho chu ahouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Pakaijin, “Jerusalem’a kamin um jing ding ahi,” ana tina Pakai Hou-In mun’ah pathen neilouho maicham ana semdoh in ahi. \x + \xo 21:4 \xt 2 Samuel 7:13\x*  
\v 5 Aman hiche van thanei ho pathen doiphung ho leh maicham phungho jouse Pakai Hou-In mun jousea ana thah tundoh kit in ahi.  
\v 6 Manasseh in ama cha tahbeh jeng jong doi pathen ho hounan ana tohdoh in, meiya ana gouvin, themka pou ana dongin, ailhimpou ana bollin, gaochang miho jong atahsan in, mitphel doithem hopou anamang chan ahi. Hiti hin aman Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin Pakai chu ana sulunghangin ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Manasseh hin Asherah semthu pathen lim jeng jong ana sem’in, Pakaijin David leh achapa Solomon ana seipehna mun laitah Hou-In sunga chun ana tungdoh in ahi. “Israel phungho jouse lah a konna kana lhendoh Jerusalem khopi leh a Hou-In'a hi kamin hi atonsot na kijabol jing ding ahi. \x + \xo 21:7 \xt 1 Lgt 9:3-5; 2 Thusimbu 7:12-18\x*  
\v 8 Israel te hin chingthei tah a kathupeh ho leh kasohpa Mose kana pehsa kadan semho hi anit sohkei uva ahileh keiman apu apateu kanapeh gamsunga konna gamdanga sohchanga kasoldoh louhel diu ahi,” ati.  
\v 9 Ahinlah hiche mipite hin sei angai pouvin, chuleh Israel te gamtepgam alut uva Pathen neilou namdang te Pathen’in ana suhmang ho sanga phamo joh boldohna ah Manasseh chun ana lamkaiyun ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Hiche jou chun Pakaijin alhachate themgao ho mangchan thu ana seijin ahi:  
\v 11 “Judah te lengpa Manasseh in thet um tah-tah thil tamtah ana boldoh in ahi. Israel te hiche gam’a achenlut masang uva anacheng Amor mite sangin angoljon ahi. Aman Judah mite hi milim semthu doilim houna a ana chonset sah in ahi.  
\v 12 Hijeh chun Pakai, Israel Pathen chun hitin aseije: Keiman Israel te Judah mipite chunga kahin pohlut ding hamsetna hi bilkol neiya jajouse tijatna a kihot ling gam diu ahi.  
\v 13 Keiman Jerusalem chunga thu katan ding hi Samaria chung le Ahab insung mite chunga kana tan bang-banga katan tohchet ding ahi. Keiman Jerusalem mipite chu min anneh na kong asop a akhup athalla asop banga ka suhmang ding ahi.  
\v 14 Hijou teng chule kamite amoh chengse jeng jong kapaidoh ding chuleh agalmi teuvin achom gam diuva ka pehdoh ding ahi.  
\v 15 Ajeh chu ama hon kamitmu’n thilse jeng abol uvin, Egypt a konna apu apateu kahin puidoh apat tuni gei hin eilunghansah jing jengun ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 16 Manasseh in themmona bei mi tamtah athat in, Jerusalem ning langkhatna kon'in ning langkhat geijin themmona bei thisan adimset tokah in athat-that jengin ahi. Hiche hi aman Judah te achonset sah chung chonna chonset abolbe sah nahlai chu ahin, hitia hi Pakai mitmua thilse bolna a ana puilut jing ahi.   
\p
\v 17 Manasseh in avaihom sunga thilsoh adang ho jouse chuleh anatoh athibol ho jouse, athilse bol ho jouse pum’in, \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu \it* a aum’in ahi.  
\v 18 Manasseh athi phat in leng inpi honsung Uzza hon a chun anavui tauvin ahi. Hijou chun achapa Amon in lengmun ahinlo tan ahi.   
\s1 Amon In Judah Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 19 Amon chu leng ahung chan chun ama kum somni le ni alhingin chuleh aman Jerusalem’ah kumni sung lengvai anapo in ahi. Anu chu Meshullemeth ahin, Jotbah khopi akon Haruz chanu ahi.  
\v 20 Ama hin apa bol-bol ana bollin, apan milimdoi ho ana hou ho ma-ma chu ana houvin ahi.  
\v 21 Ama hin apa Manasseh in anabol bang-bangin Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin ahi.  
\v 22 Aman apu apate Pathen Pakai ana paidoh in, Pakai lampi chu anajui nompon ahi.   
\p
\v 23 Hiti chun Amon noija natong pipuiho chun ama dounan tohgon ana neijun aleng inpi sunga ana that tauvin ahi.  
\v 24 Ahinlah agamsung mipi ten Amon lengpa douna tohgon ana neiho jouse chu ana that gam’un chuleh ama hon achapa Josiah chu leng mun ana losah tauvin ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Amon vaihom sunga anasoh thil dang ho jouse chuleh anatoh thilbol ho jouse \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu \it* a aum’in ahi.  
\v 26 Ama chu Uzza honsung lhan a chun ana vui tauvin ahi. Hijou chun achapa Josiah chu leng ahung chang tai.   
\c 22  
\s1 Josiah In Judah Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 1 Josiah hi leng ahungchan kum chun ama kum get bou anahi, chuleh aman Jerusalem’ah kum somthum le khat sung lengvai anahom’in ahi. Anu chu Jedidah ahin Bozkath kho a konna Adaiah chanu ahi. \x + \xo 22:1 \xt Jeremiah 3:6\x*  
\v 2 Ama hin Pathen mitmu’n thilpha jeng ana bollin, apu David khonung chu ana juijin ahi. Ama hi thildih bolna dinga ana nungchon pon ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Ama vaihom kum som le get alhinin, Josiah lengpan Meshullam tupa Azaliah chapa Shaphan chu thutanna munna lekhasunpa chu Pakai Hou-In’ah ana sollin, hiti hin thu anapen ahi,  
\v 4 “Nangma thempulen Hilkiah kom'a gache inlang, kotngah pan Pakai Hou-In'a mipi a konna adondoh u sum ho chu simtoh henlang,  
\v 5 Hou-In semphatna dinga vaihom ho khutna pelut hen, chutileh ama hon Pakai Hou-In sahphatna a natong ho chu athaman u pehnan mangcha theiyunte.  
\v 6 Ama hon thingthembol ho, insa ho chule songkhengthem ho goina a amanchah thei diu ahi. Chujongleh Hou-In semphatna man dingin thing chuleh song kikhengsa ho chule adang Hou-In semphatna dinga ngaichat umho chu chohnan mang uhen.  
\v 7 Ahinla insahna dinga vaihom ho chun akhut uva sum hunglut ho chu ajat simtoh suhtoh le kholtoh angaipoi, ajeh chu amaho lungtheng cheh leh tahsan theidol cheh ahinauve,” ati. \x + \xo 22:7 \xt 2 Lengte 12:15\x*   
\s1 Hilkiah In Pathen Danthu Ahin Mudoh  
\p
\v 8 Hilkiah thempu lenpa chun thutanna lekhasunpa kom’a chun, “Keiman Pakai Hou-In sunga chun Danbu chu kamudoh tai!” ati. Hichun Hilkiah chun hiche lekhajol chu Shaphan kom’a apen aman jong asim’in ahi.   
\p
\v 9 Shaphan chu lengpa kom’a achen thilsoh ho chu alhut in, “Nanoija mopohna neiho chun Pakai Hou-In'a sum hunglut ho chu Hou-In’a natong ho leh tohlamkai ho khutna apelut tauve,” ati.  
\v 10 Shaphan chun lengpa chu aseipeh kit in, “Hilkiah thempupa chun lekhajol khat eipe in ahi,” ati. Hichun Shaphan in jong lengpa chu asimpeh tan ahi.   
\p
\v 11 Lengpa chun hiche Dan lekhabua kijih chu ajah phat chun, lungkham tah in apon abot eh jengin ahi.  
\v 12 Hiche jou chun aman, Hilkiah thempupa, Shaphan chapa Ahikam, Micaiah chapa Acbor, Shaphan thutanna a lekhasunpa chuleh Asaiah lengpa thumop a pang, amaho kom'a chun hiche thupeh apetan ahi:  
\v 13 “Nangho cheuvin lang keima leh Judah mipi ho jouse thalhengin Pakai kom’ah tao unlang, akimudoh lekahjol akijih thucheng ho chung chang hi gakhol toh tauvin. Ajeh chu ipu ipateuvin hiche lekhajol kijih thucheng ho dungjuiya hi ana chonlou jeh uvin achung uva Pakai lunghanna hi adeojah jingin ahi. Eihon itohtei diuva kisei itoh diu thil ho chu khatcha jong ihin tong pouvin ahi,” ati.   
\p
\v 14 Hijeh chun Hilkiah thempupa, Ahikam, Achor, Shapahn leh Asaiah chu Jerusalem a chenna ding munthah langa chun Huldah themgaonu gadongtoh dingin acheuvin ahi. Amanu hi Harhas chapa Tikvah chapa Shallum jinu, Hou-In a vonchol vesuija pang ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Amanu chun amaho kom’ah chun, “Pakai, Israel Pathen chun aseije! Kile uvin lang nahinsol pau kom’a chun seiyun,  
\v 16 'Hiche hi Pakai thusei ahi, Keiman hiche khopi le amite chunga hi thohgimna kahin chuhsah ding ahi. Judah lengpan asimdoh hiche lekhajol'a kijih ho chengse hi hung guilhung tei ding ahi.  
\v 17 Ajeh chu ka miten eipaidoh tauvin, Pathen neilou namdang te semthu pathen ho kom’ah kilhaina gantha atohdoh tauvin, athilbol ho jouse jeh in keima eilunghan sah lheh tauvin ahi. Hiche mun douna a kalunghan hi deojah jeng ding ahin hiche chu chenmit jou hilou ding ahi.'   
\p
\v 18 Ahinlah Pakai hol ding’a nahin sol uvah Judah lengpa kom’a chun cheuvin lang hitin seipeh un: 'Hiche hi Pakai, Israel Pathen'in na thujah thupeh chung changa chun hitin aseije:  
\v 19 Nangma na lungkham’in , nang le nang nakisunem lheh jengin, nangin hiche khopi le amite douna a kasei hiche gam hi sapsetna aching ding chule ahomkeo hung hi ding ahi, kiti chu najah phat in lungkham tah in napon nabottel jengin chuleh kisihtah in nakap jah jengin ahi. Hijeh chun keiman tahbeh in na taona chu kajatai tin Pakaijin aseije.  
\v 20 “Hijeh chun keiman kateppeh hamsetna chu nangma nathi a lungmong’a nakivui kahsen hin chuhsah taponge. Keiman hiche khopi chunga kachuh sah ding suhgimna chu nangin namutah louding ahi,” ati.  
\p Hiti chun amanu a konna thupeh chu lengpa kom’ah ale pohlut peh tauvin ahi.   
\c 23  
\s1 Josiah In Houdan Asemphat  
\p
\v 1 Hijou chun lengpan Judah leh Jerusalem a lamkaiho jouse akoukhom’in ahi.  
\v 2 Chuin lengpa chun Judah le Jerusalem a mipi ho jouse toh thempu ho leh themgao hotoh mipi aneopen leh alenpen geijin Pakai Hou-In’ah akilhon khompi in, hichea chun Pakai Hou-In'a kimu Pakai toh kitepna lekhabu chu lengpan mipiho lah a abonchan asimphong in ahi.  
\v 3 Lengpa chu thuneina mun khompi panga chun adingin Pakai anga chun kitepna chu pan thah lahna aneipi in ahi. Aman mipi ho jouse kom'a chun, Pakai dan thupeh jouse, chondan ho jouse chu chu alungthim pumpiuva anit sohkei diuvin ngehna aneijin ahi. Hiti hin aman lekha jolla kijih Pakai toh kitepna chu asudet in ahi, chuleh mipi ho jong chun ama cheh in Pakai ang’a kitepna aneiyun ahi.   
\p
\v 4 Chuin lengpan Hilkiah thempulen chule ama sanga neojo thempuho chutoh chuleh Hou-In kotngah ho chu Baal houna leh Asherah leh vanlaijol thuneiho houna thil ho jouse chu Pakai Hou-In a konna alahdoh dingun thu apen ahi. Lengpan hiche ho jouse chu Jerusalem polanga Kidron phaicham munnah meiyin ana go-lhah sah tan ahi, avam ho chu Bethel lang’a apo mangun ahi. \x + \xo 23:4 \xt 2 Lengte 21:3; 2 Thusimbu 33:3\x*  
\v 5 Tumasang’a Judah lenghon ana pansah u doi houna a kimangcha thempu ho chu aman ana sumang gamtan ahi. Ajeh chu ama hon Judah gamsung jouse ah, pathen neilouho doiphung ang’a kilhaina ana bolji jiu ahi. Ama hon Baal, nisa le lha, ahsi ho leh van thuneina ho jouse ang’a kilhaina ana bolji jiu ahi.  
\v 6 Hichun lengpan, Asherah kihouna doikhom jong Pathen Hou-In’a kon'in aladoh in Jerusalem pamlam Kidron phaicham’ah ahallha gam in ahi. Aman doikhom ho chu agoibong in vut ason mipi kivuina lhan chunga athe thang tan ahi.  
\v 7 Aman pasal kijoh ho leh numei kijoh ho achennau mun jouse chu aphelhan, Pakai Hou-In sunga akijohnau doiphung jong asuhset peh in, hichea numei hon Asherah ahounau ponlukhuh ding akhon nau ahi.   
\p
\v 8 Josiah in, Judah khopi dang danga cheng thempuho jouse chu Jerusalem’ah ahin polut in ahi. Aman Geba le Beersheba kikah a um Pathen neilouho doiphung kilhaina gantha abolnau mun chu asuhboh peh in ahi. Aman Jerusalem a gamvaipo Joshua kelkot a hunglutna munna kithoina doiphung jong ana sumangin ahi. Hiche kelkot hi khopi lutna a kelkot veilanga um’ah ahi.  
\v 9 Hiche Pathen neilouho doiphunga thempu ana pang ho chun Jerusalem a Pakai maicham a na atoh diu ana phal pon, amavang thempu dang hotoh cholsolou changlhah aneh diu vang aphal in ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Chujou chun lengpan Ben-hinnom phaicham a um Topheth maicham jong chu ana suhboh peh in ahi. Hijeh chun hilai munna hin koiman Molech anga kat ding’a achapa hileh achanu hileh meiya govam dia kilhaina abolsah tapouvin ahi. \x + \xo 23:10 \xt Jeremiah 7:31; 19:1-6; 32:35; \xt Thempu Dan 18:21\x*  
\v 11 Aman sakol lim kisemthu Judah leng masa hon nisa houna a ana tundoh jiu jong chu Pakai Hou-In'a kon'in ana ladoh in ahi. Hiche ho chu Nathan-melech kiti nukiso thu kitanna a pipui khat in toh kinaija uma ahi. Lengpan sakol kangtalai nisa houna a ana todoh jiu jong chu ana hallha tan ahi.  
\v 12 Leng inpia Ahaz indan chungnung chungvuma inchung’a Judah te leng dang hon ana sem’u maicham phungho chu, Josiah in ana suchip in ana subeijin ahi. Chuleh Pakai Hou-In hongcha teni a Manasseh in anasem maicham jong chu lengpan ana sumangin ahi. Aman ahel hellin ana vochip in, ahel ho chu Kidron phaicham’a ana thethang'in ahi. \x + \xo 23:12 \xt 2 Lengte 21:5; 2 Thusimbu 33:5\x*  
\v 13 Solomon lengpan kidah umtah semthu doiho houna dinga Jerusalem solang chuleh Olive mol lhang langa maicham ana tundoh ho chu Josiah in asuhboh peh in ahi. Solomon in ana semdoh doi ho chu, Ashtoreth kiti kidah umtah Sidon mite numei pathen, Chemosh kiti kidah umtah Moab te pathen chuleh Molech kiti Ammon mite pathen ahiuve. \x + \xo 23:13 \xt 1 Lgt 11:7\x*  
\v 14 Josiah in doikhom jouse ana volhun, chuleh Asherah ahounau doiphung jong ana phuhlhun, hijou chun hiche munho a chun mihem gu le chang ho chu ana thekhum’in, asuhboh peh sohkeijin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Nebat chapa Jeroboam in Israel te ana chonset sahna Bethel’a semthu pathen houna chu ana jep lhun ahi. Aman adoiphung’u chu ana halvam in chuleh Asherah doikhom jong ana hal-lhai. \x + \xo 23:15 \xt 1 Lgt 12:33\x*  
\v 16 Hijou chun Josiah ahung kiheiyin avekollen ahileh mollanga lhanmol tamtah ho chu ahin mudoh in ahi. Aman aguhou chu ahin chomdoh uva Bethel doiphung ho chu suhbohna dingin achung uva guho chu ahal lhahsah dingin athupeh un ahi. (Hiche thilsoh hi Jeroboam chu kut nikhoa maicham panga ana din phat a hiche thilsoh ding hi Pakaijin Pathen mipa ana phondoh sah ahi).  
\p Chuin Josiah adadoh leh Pathen mipa lhan chu amun, ama chu hiche thilsoh ding ana phongdoh pa chu ahi. \x + \xo 23:16 \xt 1 Lgt 13:2\x*  
\v 17 “Hiche lhankhuh chu koija ham?” tia Josiah in adongin ahi.  
\p Mipi ho chun, “Hiche lhan hi Judah a konna hung Pathen mipa tunia Bethel’a na nahintoh ding ho ana seidohpa lhan chu ahi!” atiuve. \x + \xo 23:17 \xt 1 Lgt 13:30-32\x*   
\p
\v 18 Hichun Josiah in adonbut in, “Hichu limsah hih un, agu jong suboi hih un,” ati. Hijeh chun ama hon ama gu chu ahal tapouve, hitobang ma chun Samaria a kon themgaopa a jong asuloh pouvin ahi.   
\p
\v 19 Hiche jou chun Josiah in Bethel’a abol bang bangin Samaria a jong ana bollin ahi. Khopiho sunga pathen neilouho doiphung ho leh a inhou aban vohset peh in ahi. Hiche ho chu Israel leng tamtah in ana tundoh uva Pakai ana lunghan sah u anahi.  
\v 20 Hichun Josiah lengpan, pathen neilouho doi houna a thempu a pangho jouse chu amaicham chung tah uva athat in mihem guho chu amaicham chung uva ahallin hiti chun ana suhboh peh jouvin Jerusalem'a ahung kile tai.   
\s1 Josiah In Kalchuh Kut Aman  
\p
\v 21 Chuin Josiah lengpan mijouse het dingin thupeh khat aphongdoh in, “Pakai toh kitepna lekhabu dungjuijin nang hon Pakai na Pathen’u kom’a Kalchuh Kut naman tei-tei diu ahi,” ati.  
\v 22 Israel ten thutan vaihom ho khanglai apat a Israel lengte khanglai le Judah lengte khanglai geija jong hitobang Kalchuh Kut hi ana kimang kha talou ahitai.  
\v 23 Josiah leng chan kal kum som le kumget alhin kum a bou hiche Kalchuh Kut hi Jerusalem khopia hung kimang pan kit bep ahi.   
\p
\v 24 Josiah in gaochang miho jong asumangin, mitpheldoi them ho jong asubeijin, indoi le milim doi kisem tapou chu Judah gamsung le Jerusalem’a amudoh thet umtah thil tapou chu asubei jingin, Pakai Hou-In sunga Hilkiah thempu pan ahin mudoh lekhajol sunga kisun Pakai thusei jouse chu atohdoh thei teina din aboltan ahi.  
\v 25 Josiah masang'in ama tobang leng alungthim pumpi le ahinkho lhumkeija chule athaneina jousea Pakai jenga kingaija Mose danthua kisei ho aboncha jui sohkei koima ana umpon, ama nungin jong koima dang ahung umkit tapon ahi.   
\p
\v 26 Ahijeng vangin Pakai chu Judah chungah ana lunghang lheh jengin ahi. Ajeh chu Manasseh in thil phalou tamtah ana tohdoh a Pathen ana choudoh ahi.  
\v 27 Ajeh chu Pakaijin hitin ana seije, “Keiman Israel katolmang banga Judah jong katolmang soh ding ahitai. Chule Keiman ka lhendoh Jerusalem khopi leh a Hou-In a kamin kija dinga kana lhendoh jong hi kapaidoh ding ahitai,” ati.   
\p
\v 28 Josiah vaihom sunga thilsoh dang ho jouse le anatoh jouse hi \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu \it* a aum sohkeijin ahi.   
\p
\v 29 Josiah leng chan laijin Egypt lengpa Neco chun Assyria lengpa kithopi dingin Euphrates vadung lang ana jontan ahi. Josiah in asepai ho akipuijin aga kisatpin ahi. Ahinla Neco in Megiddo mun'a akimaitopin ahileh Josiah lengpa chu ama hon athat tan ahi.  
\v 30 Josiah noija sepai lamkai hon atahsa chu sakol kangtalai ah Megiddo a kon'in Jerusalem’ah ahin polut un ama lhankhuh achun ana vui tauvin ahi. Hijou chun agamsung mipi ten Josiah chapa Jehoahaz chu ama khel'in leng achansah tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Jehoahaz In Judah Gam'a Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 31 Jehoahaz chu leng ahung chan chun ama kum somni le thum ana lhingtan ahi. Chuleh aman Jerusalem’a lhathum leng ana changin ahi. Anu chu Libnah khopi a konna Jeremiah chanu Hamutal ahi.  
\v 32 Ama hin apu apateu chonna bang bangin Pathen deilou jeng ana bollin ahi.   
\p
\v 33 Pharaoh Neco in Johoahaz chu Jerusalem’a avaihom louna dingin Hamath gam’ah Riblah mun’ah songkulla aheng in ahi. Chule aman Judah ten dangka pound 7,500 chuleh sana pound 75 kai apeh dingin ana ngeh in ahi.   
\s1 Jehoiakim In Judah Gam'a Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 34 Hichun Pharaoh Neco in Josiah chate lah a khat Eliakim kitipa chu apa khellin leng chang dingin atung in, amin jong akhel peh in, Jehoiakim asah tan ahi. Ahin Jehoahaz vang chu Egypt gam'a sohchang dingin apuijin hikom’a chun ahung thiden tan ahi. \x + \xo 23:34 \xt Jeremiah 22:11,12\x*   
\p
\v 35 Pharaoh Neco kom’a kai apeh jouna dingun Jehoiakim in Judah mipite lah a kon'in sana le dangka ama-ama nei le neilou dungjuijin adongin ahi.   
\p
\v 36 Jehoiakim chu leng ahung chan kum chun ama kum somni le nga ana lhingtan ahi. Jerusalem'a chun kum som le khat sung vai ana hom in ahi. Anu chu Rumah khopi akon Pedaiah chanu Zebidah ahi. \x + \xo 23:36 \xt Jeremiah 22:18,19; 26:1-6; 35:1-19\x*  
\v 37 Ama jong hin apu apate bang bangin Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng ana bollin ahi.   
\c 24  
\p
\v 1 Jehoiakim vaihom laijin Babylon lengpa Nebuchadnezzar in Judah gam’ah gal ahin sattan ahileh, Jehoiakim in kisatpi louvin ama le agamsung jouse chu Nebuchadnezzar khut ah ana kipelut tan ahi. Aman kum thum sungin kai anapen, chuche jouvin akiphin tan ahi. \x + \xo 24:1 \xt Jeremiah 25:1-38; Daniel 1:1,2\x*  
\v 2 Hichun Pakaijin Babylon mite, Aram mite, Moab mite, Ammon mite ahin tildoh in Pakaijin themgao ho kam’a ana phondoh sah bang bangin aguilhung tan ahi.  
\v 3 Hitobang hamsetna Judah gam’ah ahunglhun hi Pakai thupeh akon ahi. Aman amitmua konna Judah te atolmang kigotna ajeh hi Manasseh in thilse tamtah ana boldoh jeh ahi.  
\v 4 Chule Jerusalem a themmona neilou thisan anaso a ana hesosah jeh ahi. Pakaijin hichu a ngaidam lou ahi.   
\p
\v 5 Jehoiakim vaihom sunga thilsoh dang ho jouse jong \it Judah Lengte Thusimbu \it* a aumin ahi.  
\v 6 Jehoiakim chu athi phat in, achapa Jehoiachin lengin ahung pang tan ahi.   
\p
\v 7 Egypt lengpa hiche jou apat hin gal ahung kondoh jou tapon ahi, ajeh chu Babylon lengpan Egypt hi kagam ahi tia ahopsah chengse chu Babylon lengpan abon'a alahpeh soh ahitai. Aman ana kilahlut gam ho chu Egypt vadung apat Euphrates vadung chan gei ahi.   
\s1 Jehoiachin In Judah Gam'a Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 8 Jehoiachin chu aleng chan kum chun ama kum som le kum get alhing tan ahi, chuleh aman Jerusalem chu lha thum bou lengvai anapon ahi. Anu chu Jerusalem akon Elnathan chanu Nehushta ahi.  
\v 9 Jehoiachin in apa bang bangin Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng anabol in ahi.   
\p
\v 10 Jehoiachin vaihom sungin, Nebuchadnezzar in Babylon a kon'in anoija sepai pipuiho ahinsol'in Jerusalem ahung umkhum tauvin ahi.  
\v 11 Hichun Nebuchadnezzar ama tah jong hiche khopi aum sungu hin ahunglhung tan ahi.  
\v 12 Hichun Jehoiachin lengpan lengnu toh ama thumop hotoh, asepai lamkaiho le pipuho Babylon te khut ah akipelut tauvin ahi.  
\p Nebuchadnezzar in lengvai ahom kum get alhin kumin, Jehoiachin chu songkul'ah akhum tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 24:12 \xt Jeremiah 22:24-30; 24:1-10; 29:1,2\x*   
\p
\v 13 Pakaijin ana phondohsa bangin Nebuchadnezzar in Pakai Hou-In a kon'in chuleh leng inpia kon'in sum le pai, sana dangka, nei le gou ho jouse le, sana a kisem thil ho jouse, Solomon’in Hou-In a ana koiho abonchan achomtheng heltan ahi.  
\v 14 Hiti chun Nebuchadnezzar in Jerusalem khopi sung’a cheng jouse, asepai lamkai ho jouse le sepai galsat themho jouse, khut thepna neiho le thilsem themho abonchan mihem 10,000 gal-hingin akaiyun ahi. Gamsung'a chun avaicha kheh ho bou adalha uvin ahi.   
\p
\v 15 Nebuchadnezzar in Jehoiachin lengpa, lengnu anu, ajite ho chule apipuiho jaonan Babylon gam'a akaimang tan ahi \x + \xo 24:15 \xt Ezekiel 17:12\x*  
\v 16 Chuleh aman sepai ahangsan cheh 7,000 leh khut thepna neiho abon’un mihat galsat thei cheh 1,000 ho chu gam chom’ah asoldoh tan ahi.  
\v 17 Hichun Babylon lengpan Jehoiachin pangah pa Mattaniah chu lengin atungin, chule amin jong akhellin, Zedekiah asahtai. \x + \xo 24:17 \xt Jeremiah 37:1; Ezekiel 17:13\x*   
\s1 Zedekiah In Judah Gamsung Lengvai Apoh  
\p
\v 18 Zedekiah leng ahung chan kum chun ama kum somni le khat ana lhingtan ahi. Aman Jerusalem’ah kum som le khat sungin lengvai ana pon ahi. Anu chu Libnah akon Jeremiah chanu Hamutal ahi. \x + \xo 24:18 \xt Jeremiah 27:1-22; 28:1-17\x*  
\v 19 Ahinlah Zedekiah in Jehoiakim bol bang bangin Pakai mitmu’n thilse jeng anabol’in ahi.  
\v 20 Jerusalem leh Judah chung’a thilsoh ho achuhna jeh hi, Pakai lunghan jeh ahi. Hijeh chun Pakaijin ama angsunga konna apaidoh a, hitia hi gamchom’a sohchang gam’ah ahi tauve. \x + \xo 24:20 \xt Ezekiel 17:15\x*  
\s1 Jerusalem Khopi Chim  
\p Zedekiah hin Babylon lengpa a kon'in kiphinna anei tan ahi.   
\c 25  
\p
\v 1 Hiti chun Zedekiah lengvai ahom kal kum ko alhin kum, Tolbol 15 nin Babylon lengpa Nebuchadnezzar in asepai jouse ahin puijin Jerusalem khopi chu ahin bulu tan ahi. Ama hon khopi chu aum’uvin pal akai khum tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 25:1 \xt Jeremiah 21:1-10; 34:1-5; Ezekiel 24:2\x*  
\v 2 Zedekiah lengpan lengvai ahom kal kum som le khat alhin in, Jerusalem chu galmi ten aumkhum tan ahi.   
\p
\v 3 Zedekiah vaihom kal kum som le khat lhin kum'a Lhamul 18 nikhon, khopi sunga neh ding akilhasam'in, akhoh lheh tan, anneh twidon ding akinehchai gam tauvin ahi.  
\v 4 Hijou chun khopi pal chu themkhat avutvang’un, chule sepai ho jouse chu ajam gam tauvin ahi. Ajeh chu khopi chu Babylon ten aumkhum chahkheh chule janbkhovah hella achanlhih jeng vangun, pal le pal kikah a lengpa honleiya chun ajamdoh tauve. Amaho chu Jordan Phaicham lang jonin ache tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 25:4 \xt Ezekiel 33:21\x*   
\p
\v 5 Ahinlah Babylon sepai hon lengpa chu adellun Jericho phaicham’a chun aman tauve, ajeh chu asepai ten adalhah uva kithecheh gam'a ahi tauve.  
\v 6 Ama hon Riblah kho mun'a Babylon lengpa kom alhut tauvin, hilai mun'ah chun Zedekiah lengpa chu achungthu atan tauvin ahi.  
\v 7 Ama hon achateu atha peh uchu avetsah un ahi. Hijou chun amit akaldoh peh un sum-eng khaoguija akanun Babylon lang’ah akai tauvin ahi. \x + \xo 25:7 \xt Ezekiel 12:13\x*   
\s1 Hou-In Kisuhchim  
\p
\v 8 Nebuchadnezzar lengpa leng chan kal kum som le ko lhin kum, Lhajing 14 nikhon Babylon lengpa sepai pipui chuleh leng vesui lah a lamkaipa Nebuzaradan chu Jerusalem ahunglhung tan ahi.  
\v 9 Hichun aman Pakai Hou-In, leng inpi chuleh Jerusalem a in jouse ahal lhan chuleh khopi sunga insang aphadom jouse jong asuse gam tan ahi. \x + \xo 25:9 \xt 1 Lgt 9:8\x*  
\v 10 Chujongleh aman Babylon sepai ho jouse chu Jerusalem pal ho avohlhuh sah in, ajet aveija um jouse jong asuhset sah sohkeijin ahi.  
\v 11 Babylon lengpa tahsa vesuija pang ho lamkaipa Nebuzaradan chun, Jerusalem khopi sunga ana kidalha mipi amoh chengse, Babylon lengpa lang’a ana pang chengse chutoh mipi ahon jamah amoh chengse chu sohchang dingin ahin toldoh tauvin ahi.  
\v 12 Hichea hin Sepai lamkaipa hin mipiho lah a avaichapen ho chu lengpilei leh lou lhou dingin adalhan ahi.   
\p
\v 13 Pakai Hou-In maiya sum-eng khom kiphut ho leh Pakai Hou-In sunga sum-eng twikonglen atunna sum-enga kisem chengse jong chu Babylon sepai ten avochip del'un, sum-eng chengse chu Babylon lamah akipoh tauve. \x + \xo 25:13 \xt 1 Lgt 7:15-26; 2 Thusimbu 3:15-17; \xt 1 Lgt 7:23-26; 2 Thusimbu 4:2-5\x*  
\v 14 Chujongleh Babylon mite chun bel jouse le tupheng jouse jong, chaiche ho ahin gimnamtui halnamna lhengho ahin, Hou-In kin bolna dinga kisem sum-enga kibol um le bel, lheng le kong abonchan akipoh mang tauve. \x + \xo 25:14 \xt 1 Lgt 7:45; 2 Thusimbu 4:16\x*  
\v 15 Sepai lamkaipa Nebuzaradan chun gimnamtui kihalna le kong ho chule sana le dangka thengsel'a kisem thil dang-dang ho jouse jong akilah gam’in ahi.   
\p
\v 16 Sum-eng’a kisem khompi teni, twikonglen, akhom atunna tenia kimang um le bel, lheng le konga kimang sum-eng chengse chu agihdan anasa behseh jengin tejou hilou ahi. Hiche thilkeo ho se-se hi Solomon lengpan Pakai Hou-In'a pang dinga anasem ho chu ahi.  
\v 17 Khomkhat chu asandan feet 7-1/2 alhingin, aluvum'a chu alutom ding sum-enga kisem asandan tong thum cheh alhingin,chule khut them lah a kijempah a kolbuthei pahcha jem banga aluvum kimvella kisem sohkei ahi.   
\p
\v 18 Nebuzaradan, sepai lamkaipa chun thempulen Seraiah le thempu ni lhinna Zephaniah kitipa chutoh kelkot ngah a pangji mithum chutoh sohchang dingin akai mangin ahi.  
\v 19 Chujongleh khopi sunga akisel nalai mipi holah a kon'in, Judah te dia gal lamkaipa leh lengpa thumop a pang mi nga, sepai te gamsungmi simtoh le a pang alamkai pauvin lekhasun’a amanpa leh khopi sunga kimandoh mi somgup chutoh ana kaimang than ahi.  
\v 20 Sepai lamkaipa Nebuzaradan chun, amaho jouse chu Riblah khomun ah Babylon lengpa henga ahinkai luttan ahi..  
\v 21 Riblah kho Hamath gamsunga chun Babylon lengpan abonchauvin adengin athat sohtai. Chuin Judah mite chu agamsung uva kon'in sohchang din aki kaimang soh tauvin ahi.   
\s1 Gedaliah In Judah Gam'a Vai Apoh  
\p
\v 22 Hijou chun Nebuchadnezzar lengpan Shaphan tupa, Ahikam chapa Gedaliah chu Judah gam’a hung kidalha mipi ho chunga gamvaipo dingin ana pansah in ahi. \x + \xo 25:22 \xt Jeremiah 40:7-9\x*  
\v 23 Babylon lengpa Nebucahdnezzar in Gedaliah kitipa hi gamvaipon apansah tai ti Judah mi sepai ho leh apipui houvin ajah phat un, ama hon Gedaliah chu Mizpah a kimupi din ana cheuvin ahi. Amaho chu Nethaniah chapa Ishmael, Kareah chapa Johanan, Netophath khomi Tanhumeth chapa Seraiah, Maacath khomi chapa Jezaniah chule akho midang jouse ahiuve.   
\p
\v 24 Hichun Gedaliah chu amaho kom’a chun akihahsel’in hitin aseije, “Ima kichatna le tijatna nei hih hellun, gamsunga chun lungmong in chengun, chule Babylon lengpa thu hi ngaiyun, chutile nangho dinga ima jouse phajeng ding ahi,” tin alungmon sah’un ahi.   
\p
\v 25 Ahivangin hiche kum'a lhasagi lhin phat in leng insunga peng mi, Elishama tupa Nethaniah chapa Ishmael chu sepai somkhat toh ahung kon'in Mizpah khoa hin Gedaliah leh Judah mite toh Babylon mite umkhom apanpi chengse chu ahung delkhum'un athat tauve. \x + \xo 25:25 \xt Jeremiah 41:1-3\x*   
\p
\v 26 Hiche jou chun Judah ho aneova pat alenpen geijin chujongleh asepai lamkaiho geijin kichatah in Egypt lang’ah ajam gam tauvin ahi, ajeh chu Babylon miten i-ahinlo diu ham tichu kicha a ahiuve. \x + \xo 25:26 \xt Jeremiah 43:5-7\x*   
\s1 Jehoiachin Babylon Gam'a Hung Kilhadoh Le Kijabol  
\p
\v 27 Judah lengpa Jehoiachin sohchanna kum somthum le sagi lhin kum'in Evil-merodach chun Babylon lengmun ahinlo tan ahile, Jehoiachin chu akhoto in songkul'a kon'in alhadoh tan ahi.  
\v 28 Ama hin Jehoiachin chu ngailutna neitah in akihoupi in, Babylon’a leng dang kihen ho sangin mun sang apen jana ana pen ahi.  
\v 29 Aman Jehoiachin chu songkul von khel chun vonthah anapen chuleh ahinkho lhung keija lengpa toh an nekhom dingin phalna ana pen ahi.  
\v 30 Hiti chun Babylon lengpan ahinkho lhumkeiya niseh a aneh ding an agontoh peh in, ama neh ding chan khat akisem jing jeng tan ahi.   